msgid "（仮）桜イベント２\nＢＢの登場で落ち込む桜を慰める。"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "507484"
msgid "Um… may I, ask you something?\nIt's about #C236196003Meltlilith#CDEF…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "507736"
msgid "That girl… #C236196003Meltlilith#CDEF is a part of us,\nthe Sakura Series."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "507820"
msgid "She… um, said all those things, to you…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "508320"
msgid "Despite how #C236196003Meltlilith#CDEF looks,\ndo you consider an #C000246204Alter Ego#CDEF to be\npart of my series?"
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "508436"
msgid "I think so."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "508464"
msgid "…………………!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "508704"
msgid "Of course.\nAh, sorry. I asked you a weird question."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "517356"
msgid "…so, how it feel like to be dived into?\nDoes it tickle? Does it hurt?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "517936"
msgid "Erm… It didn't hurt.\nIt tickled a little… I guess."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "518464"
msgid "Wow, how bold…\nBut it sounds like it might be fun鷙"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "518680"
msgid "I'm ready whenever you are.\nOkay, bring it on!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "518728"
msgid "U-uh…\nPlease be careful during your dive, okay?\nIt's still dangerous…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "524008"
msgid "#C236196003#GIVEN#CDEF?\nIs something the matter…?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "524516"
msgid "Huh? Umm……… What is it?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "524544"
msgid "I explain that it's a classic\nTsukumihara school uniform I got for her."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "524708"
msgid "No…… I can't! Sm is such a precious resource!\nTo use it on a uniform for me……!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "525024"
msgid "Was I being presumptuous after all……?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "525272"
msgid "……really?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "525288"
msgid "Really."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "525300"
msgid "Really, really?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "525316"
msgid "Really, really.\nSo please don't look so down."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "525780"
msgid "Of course, don't mind if I do."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "533640"
msgid "…………………"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "533660"
msgid "#C236196003Sakura#CDEF…?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "533848"
msgid "Ah… #C236196003#GIVEN#CDEF…\nI'm sorry. I was daydreaming."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "534132"
msgid "No, that's not it.\nWhile Psycho Dives are difficult to process,\nI was assisting #C236196003Kiara#CDEF, so it was fine."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "534256"
msgid "More importantly…\n#C236196003BB#CDEF has been weighing on my mind…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "535420"
msgid "Uuugh. Why…!\nI'm seriously worried here…!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "535472"
msgid "That worry has gone much too far."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "535928"
msgid "#C236196003#GIVEN#CDEF…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "536144"
msgid "Isn't that… right…?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "536488"
msgid "#C236196003#GIVEN#CDEF.\nThank you very much for paying me a visit."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "582880"
msgid "But there was only medicine inside.\nProbably the kind that has to stay chilled."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "583276"
msgid "…close call."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "583300"
msgid "You   have found   an herb!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "583500"
msgid "And so with that…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "583520"
msgid "#C236196003#FAMILY #GIVEN#CDEF   discarded   the herb!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "583776"
msgid "The world may be vast, but people this perfect\nat making beds are pretty rare."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "583944"
msgid "It's a simple table with a plastic table cloth draped over it.\nIt's a nice highlight to an otherwise drab infirmary."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "584236"
msgid "―――pai. Senpai."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "584256"
msgid "Can you hear me right now?\nPlease, open your eyelids slowly\nand carefully."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "584344"
msgid "\n……I hear a familiar voice."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "584396"
msgid "My hazy vision and consciousness come back to me.\nSpurred on by the voice that's concerned about me,\nmy heavy eyelids open―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "584600"
msgid "An old-fashioned infirmary I've never seen on #C000246204SE.RA.PH#CDEF,\nin a style that no longer exists on the surface."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "585016"
msgid "In place of a greeting, I say \"Thank you.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "585060"
msgid "――――――."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "585076"
msgid "……?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "585084"
msgid "Huh. For some reason,\n#C236196003Sakura#CDEF is making a really curious expression."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "585176"
msgid "Is there something weird on my face?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "585232"
msgid "Oh, no―――I'm sorry, it's nothing.\nThere's nothing you need to worry about,\n#C236196003#GIVEN#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "585336"
msgid "I don't quite know why,\nbut when I heard your voice,\nmy mind went blank for a moment."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "585892"
msgid "Where am I?\nAnd why in the world was I sleeping here?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "586024"
msgid "#C236196003#FAMILY #GIVEN#CDEF.\nDo you know who you are?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "586256"
msgid "I'm one of the #RUBS   Magi#RUBE#C000246204Wizards#REND#CDEF who came to the Moon\nto attain the rights to the wish-granting #C000246204Holy Grail#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "586580"
msgid "#RUBS   Magi#RUBE#C000246204Wizards#REND#CDEF are a special type of hacker\ncapable of having their selves, their souls enter cyberspace."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "586856"
msgid "That occult-like approach led to a new age\nin the transmission of information.\nOf those hackers, the A-Rank hackers among them\nwere conferred the title of #ROFS0001#RUBS  Magus#RUBE#C000246204Wizard#CDEF#REND."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "587432"
msgid "This is the Moon.\nSpecifically, the legacy of an alien civilization\nthat was discovered inside of the Moon:\nthe Artificial Spiritron Calculation Apparatus,\nthe #REND#C000246204Moon Cell Automaton#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "588000"
msgid "This #C000246204Moon Cell#CDEF built a virtual cyberspace inside of itself\ncalled the #C000246204SE.RA.PH#CDEF, gathering #RUBS   Magi#RUBE#C000246204Wizards#REND#CDEF from all around the wor―\nor rather, the Earth."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "588224"
msgid "This would be one of the school-styled grounds\nmade in that #C000246204SE.RA.PH#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "588796"
msgid "The weak won't reach the #C000246204Holy Grail#CDEF.\nYou must surpass all others……\nand prove yourself as the strongest."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "589160"
msgid "That is, a #C000246204Servant#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "589700"
msgid "Of course―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "589716"
msgid "I do―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "589728"
msgid "――――Wait."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "590240"
msgid "Memory loss……"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "590384"
msgid "I can remember…… I was in the #C000246204Holy Grail War#CDEF,\nbut nothing about what battles I fought,\nor what opponents I defeated."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "590524"
msgid "There's only a little I do remember vividly."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "590708"
msgid "And…… that I was saved from that predicament\nby my Servant, #C236196003#SVT[Saber][Archer][Caster][who was some unknown man]##CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "591100"
msgid "Huh? Don't tell me, that means……\n……um, #C236196003#GIVEN#CDEF?\nDo you, know my name?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "591200"
msgid "So #C236196003Sakura#CDEF asked nervously."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "591244"
msgid "It seems like she's wondering if I forgot about her.\nHer name is, of course―――"
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "591352"
msgid "Francis Xavier"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "591440"
msgid "But, you are right……\nThere's nothing for me to correct about it……"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "591588"
msgid "Th-that should be……\nBut when #C236196003Leo#CDEF said the same,\nI didn't feel anything……"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "591692"
msgid "Yes. I am #C236196003Sakura Matou#CDEF.\nIt's good to see you again."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "591988"
msgid "Not at all."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "592396"
msgid "Behind that sweet smile was a fierce pressure."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "593328"
msgid "The #C236196003#FAMILY #GIVEN#CDEF I know has never\nbeen one to sit still for very long."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "593716"
msgid "\"Yeah,\" I nod in answer."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "593984"
msgid "Also, your Servant is waiting for you in\n#C000246204the classroom of the right-side hallway\non the 2nd floor#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "594104"
msgid "Please make sure you don't forget to\n#C000246204check your Servant's parameters#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "595172"
msgid "#C236196003Gilgamesh#CDEF called me his Master,\nbut did he really become my Servant?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "596284"
msgid "Could it really be that she thinks\nshe \"has no more secrets\"?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "597076"
msgid "But, no program is perfect. Even if each\nindividual part is perfect, when two parts\ncollide, the reaction can breed flaws."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "597276"
msgid "If you can agitate, or even make #C236196003Rani#CDEF excited,\nyou might be able to get a glimpse of her #C000246204SG#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "597404"
msgid "…the hell are you―― Don't talk to me!\nUnlike you, I'm busy, see?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "597804"
msgid "Did you know? Conflict only breaks out\nbetween those of equal levels.\nKid bait only baits kids."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "597912"
msgid "Thaaat aside…\nWhy do you know about Darling's problems?\nDid you eavesdrop in so-me-whe-re, hmmm?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "598700"
msgid "#C236196003Jinako#CDEF doesn't know much about real,\ninterpersonal relationships. Do you, #C236196003Karna#CDEF?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "599392"
msgid "#C236196003Rani#CDEF's final secret… Hmm.\nIt's difficult to say, since I've never met\n#C236196003Rani#CDEF… What's your take, #C236196003Andersen#CDEF?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "600024"
msgid "…are you serious? A harpy like you should\nbe able to smell a fragrant girl's pretension\nall the way from the Labyrinth."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "600284"
msgid "…I don't understand what you mean, but…\nhave you completely figured out #C236196003Rani#CDEF's secret?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "600392"
msgid "Yes. Thus, I can't give advice. Giving a girl's\nsecret to outsiders is the height of stupidity.\nLike praising flowers while you pluck them."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "600668"
msgid "Or what, #C236196003Kiara#CDEF?\nAre you telling me to become an honest writer,\nputting the plain truth down with my pen?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "600800"
msgid "…*sigh*. You really are a pain to deal with.\nI apologize, #C236196003#FAMILY#CDEF.\nPlease seek help from someone else."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "601116"
msgid "#C236196003Sakura#CDEF…?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "601348"
msgid "…um. Are you really going in there?\nThis #C000246204Sentinel#CDEF is different from the one before."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "601456"
msgid "#C236196003Lancer#CDEF's stats surpass your Servant's,\n#C236196003#GIVEN#CDEF. Your chance of winning, counting\na standard deviation, is 40%."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "601612"
msgid "While I say that I'll back you up,\nI don't believe that you can win."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "601744"
msgid "…so, please answer me this.\n#C236196003#FAMILY#CDEF #C236196003#GIVEN#CDEF. Why do you fight?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "602228"
msgid "Ah, of course.\nIf we don't stop #C236196003BB#CDEF now, things\nwill become even worse."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "602552"
msgid "So…\nUm, please make it back safe and sound!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "602600"
msgid "Eh, u-uh…\nDo I seem like I'm in pain…!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "602648"
msgid "She does, at least to me."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "602684"
msgid "She's an AI whose thinking may differ from my own,\nbut I saw with my own eyes that she was suffering."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "602992"
msgid "…………\n…………\n…………um, err."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "603052"
msgid "May I hear that one more time?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "603244"
msgid "………um.\nAs an AI that manages everyone's health,\nhearing this is strange…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "603856"
msgid "I open the curtain."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "604056"
msgid "Her lips were damp, as if they were honey."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "604112"
msgid "Yeah――It's as if she's alive――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "604156"
msgid "\n\n\n#C080080080Suddenly, I'm assaulted by a dizziness akin to deja vu.#CDEF"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "604408"
msgid "Huh… is that you, #C236196003#GIVEN#CDEF?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "604580"
msgid "Behind the curtains, there's the sound of rustling clothes."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "604780"
msgid "Despite being an AI, she was so full of life\nthat she was more human than a human."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "605016"
msgid "#C236196003Sakura#CDEF interacts with a smile; but her face\nis still deep with fatigue. Even the texture\nof her hair seems off."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "605148"
msgid "\"Are you feeling alright?\" I ask."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "605904"
msgid "…um, if I told you that your visit caused my\nstructural load to auto-restore by 50%,\nwould you believe me?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "606716"
msgid "Sen… #C236196003#GIVEN#CDEF!?\nW-why are you here?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "606776"
msgid "#C236196003Sakura#CDEF looks at me, perplexed.\nShe's acting like she saw a ghost."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "606952"
msgid "So that's why.\nThank you for going out of your way\nto pay me a visit."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "607428"
msgid "…u-umm… What could I do now…? What could…\nAh, I know! How about a medical check?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "607552"
msgid "I'm only in a daze because I'm entranced by her movements."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "607628"
msgid "O-oh, okay… Uhh…\nI have nothing… else to suggest…\n…but, um."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "607784"
msgid "I-it's weird for an AI like me to\nbe asking this…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "607844"
msgid "? What's weird about it? I don't see why."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "608040"
msgid "A-alright…!\nThank you…!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "608084"
msgid "O-okay. Please sit tight.\nWe don't get to do this often,\nso have your fill of my goods!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "608172"
msgid "―――!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "608184"
msgid "F-fill of her goods?\nWhat is #C236196003Sakura#CDEF talking about!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "608372"
msgid "…huh? Is something wrong?\nPerhaps your heart rate is elevated?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "608440"
msgid "Okay. Tea. Okay."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "608528"
msgid "Tea, no problem.\nBetter, I'll humbly partake."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "608848"
msgid "…this moment is peaceful."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "608928"
msgid "……Senpai?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "609160"
msgid "――――――."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "609184"
msgid "NOW I know."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "609200"
msgid "I had realized that I'm #C236196003#FAMILY #GIVEN#CDEF,\na Master inside the #C000246204SE.RA.PH#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "609648"
msgid "…I stand atop their corpses."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "609692"
msgid "I don't regret it.\nI mustn't."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "610828"
msgid "…her compassion eases the pain in my heart."
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "611080"
msgid "That's not true."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "611460"
msgid "…but, it's so very… strange, even to me.\nTo me, Senpai, you're, um…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "612064"
msgid "#C236196003Sakura#CDEF smiles bashfully."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "612300"
msgid "? Countless times, here?\nWith me?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "612412"
msgid "It's just your imagination, #C236196003#GIVEN#CDEF.\nI've spoken with you three times here so far."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "612620"
msgid "――――Oh. I see."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "612648"
msgid "Something is bugging me,\nbut I don't think #C236196003Sakura#CDEF would lie."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "613560"
msgid "…ah… #C236196003#GIVEN#CDEF―is that you?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "613960"
msgid "Oh, my hair?\nPlease don't worry about it.\nMy output has fallen a little, is all."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "614200"
msgid "It's fine. Resting in bed doesn't\ndo much for me."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "614440"
msgid "Watch out…!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "614456"
msgid "#C236196003Sakura#CDEF stumbles, and I only barely catch her."
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "614732"
msgid "Are you really alright?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "614788"
msgid "………well, that, umm………"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "615472"
msgid "But I can still be of use.\n#C236196003Rin#CDEF and #C236196003Rani#CDEF are constantly giving me updates."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "616028"
msgid "There were no bluffs in her smile.\nShe's genuinely concerned about me."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "616260"
msgid "Sakurament―――That's right. Sakurament."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "616912"
msgid "… …\nSenpai… you dummy…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "617080"
msgid "AI like #C236196003Sakura#CDEF probably take it as\n\"belonging to them\" more seriously than us Masters do."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "617192"
msgid "…I'm sorry, Senpai. But… thank you very much.\nI feel warmer inside… and far more comfortable."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "617412"
msgid "…I'm glad.\nThis should keep her pain away for a while."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "617480"
msgid "……………………\n……………………\n……………………"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "617540"
msgid "? What's up with #C236196003Sakura#CDEF?\nI thought her pain went away,\nbut she's oddly fidgety."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "618332"
msgid "Oh―――I-is that how it is?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "618604"
msgid "I nod, \"T-that could very well be.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "619092"
msgid "I-it's nothing!\nPlease don't worry about me!\nI'm an AI, after all!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "619576"
msgid "No worries. #C236196003Rin#CDEF and #C236196003Rani#CDEF are supporting\nmy health. Please trust in their\nprogramming skills."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "620612"
msgid "…Senpai? Is that you?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "621220"
msgid "#C236196003Sakura#CDEF is clearly pushing herself."
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "621648"
msgid "…keep playing along."
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "621676"
msgid "…ask about her feelings."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "622100"
msgid "Do I like… Senpai?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "622260"
msgid "A Senpai like that deserves my\ncooperation, right?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "622536"
msgid "Umm, I don't think that hypothetical\neven warrants a simulation.\nSenpai's priority would go down―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "622640"
msgid "………………eh?\n……………………\n……………………!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "622700"
msgid "I-I don't understand.\nI feel strange.\nWhat is this…?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "622868"
msgid "\"Human.\"\nI say this, and #C236196003Sakura#CDEF clams up."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "622944"
msgid "Apparently to her, an AI, she must never be human-like."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "623176"
msgid "―――!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "623188"
msgid "…y-you're mistaken.\nYou must be mistaken, Senpai."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "623240"
msgid "I mean…\nI don't know what \"love\" is."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "623684"
msgid "#C236196003Sakura#CDEF, blushing, looks down and stops talking."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "623748"
msgid "\"Science denies love.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "623948"
msgid "No \"love\" is involved."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "624168"
msgid "Eh―――What's up with that?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "624676"
msgid "I tell her how I feel.\n\"Don't push yourself at least.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "624736"
msgid "Ah―――okay.\nI'm, um, ready―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "624772"
msgid "―――Phew.\n…I'm sorry for bothering you again with this."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "624832"
msgid "But I'm happy.\nIt of course helps numb the pain, but, um…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "624896"
msgid "I know how much you care for me."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "625068"
msgid "Please wait.\n…may I ask a question myself?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "625124"
msgid "It's about #C236196003BB#CDEF.\nI cannot bring myself to like #C236196003BB#CDEF.\n…I despise her."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "625232"
msgid "But what about you, Senpai?\nHow do you see #C236196003BB#CDEF?"
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "625300"
msgid "I may like her."
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "625320"
msgid "I may hate her."
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "625340"
msgid "I'm not sure."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "625600"
msgid "…she asks, then I start to mull it over."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "625824"
msgid "…I see.\nStill, we have to fight #C236196003BB#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "626032"
msgid "I am."
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "626040"
msgid "I'm not."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "626240"
msgid "That's not enough.\nI also want to protect the girl standing before me."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "626316"
msgid "Ehhh!?\nY-you don't have to, I'm an AI!\nI'm just a system!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "626468"
msgid "That's how I truly feel."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "626992"
msgid "I tell her how I feel.\n\"Don't push yourself at least.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "627624"
msgid "…I'm sorry.\nYou were right, Senpai."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "627672"
msgid "Those \"memories\" belonged to me.\nIt was in an AI format, so I knew\nfrom the start."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "628440"
msgid "Yeah. I spent many days chatting with her here."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "628916"
msgid "I still don't know why that happened to\nme at that time."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "629296"
msgid "―――A single day, repeated 69 times."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "629336"
msgid "Oh―――So that's what happened."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "629436"
msgid "…all I can do is confirm that those\nevents took place."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "629500"
msgid "I―\nErased all those memories."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "629692"
msgid "128 #RUBS   Magi#RUBE#C000246204Wizards#REND#CDEF are invited from Earth\nand chosen to become Masters.\nThe #C000246204SE.RA.PH#CDEF is reconstructed each time."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "630048"
msgid "I was an advanced AI with a role, so while my\nprogram wouldn't be deleted, the experience I\ngained during those battles would be reset."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "630820"
msgid "―――So, that's how it is."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "631400"
msgid "I never met her, but she must be one hell of an AI."
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "632328"
msgid "…is that actually true?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "633072"
msgid "…is that really true…?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "633408"
msgid "…that's all I have to say about that.\nSen… no, #C236196003#GIVEN#CDEF.\nPlease fight to ensure you survive."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "634000"
msgid "…I'm sorry.\nAnd I also truly thank you."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "634200"
msgid "…this is fine.\nI have no means by which to save her, an AI."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "634380"
msgid "…I'm not fine."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "634396"
msgid "I'm not fine with that."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "634532"
msgid "Besides―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "634548"
msgid "Eh―――Sen, pai?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "634572"
msgid "#C236196003Sakura#CDEF isn't expendable.\nShe's here, alive."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "634636"
msgid "AI or not, she's an important #[girl][friend]# to me."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "634864"
msgid "―――."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "634876"
msgid "…you're mean.\nYou're mean, Senpai."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "635012"
msgid "Yet… my chest aches.\nI know I did the right thing, so why?\nWhy is this so painful for me―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "635348"
msgid "Still―――I believe that those days meant\nsomething to both #C236196003Sakura#CDEF and me."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "635552"
msgid "But…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "635564"
msgid "And no \"buts,\" I add."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "635600"
msgid "………okay.\nI don't know if I can pull it off, but I'll try."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "636136"
msgid "I carve this into my mind:\nfor that smile, I will triumph."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "636972"
msgid "Thanks for waiting.\nAnd sorry for always serving you the\nsame old tea…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "637096"
msgid "All the tea I've ever drank in the #C000246204SE.RA.PH#CDEF\ntasted exactly how I remember the real thing did."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "637516"
msgid "I've gotten used to the taste of tea in the #C000246204SE.RA.PH#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "638280"
msgid "…#C236196003#GIVEN#CDEF. Um, just looking\nat your heart rate and brain waves… Are you\nenjoying this?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "638468"
msgid "\"Am I enjoying this\"…?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "638500"
msgid "Sure, I am pretty relaxed."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "638812"
msgid "It's tough for me to see #C236196003Rin#CDEF and #C236196003Rani#CDEF\nlook so down and you forcing yourself\nto laugh, #C236196003#GIVEN#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "639940"
msgid "To me, it, um…\nLooks like you want to die, #C236196003#GIVEN#CDEF…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "640032"
msgid "To me, it, um…\nLooks like you want to die, Senpai."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "640096"
msgid "――――――."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "640112"
msgid "Oh. So that's how I looked like to #C236196003Sakura#CDEF.\nShe misread my mental state,\nbut her thoughts on the situation were right."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "640248"
msgid "I mean, it's just about all over."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "640500"
msgid "Are you saying… that you haven't quit yet?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "640688"
msgid "She's right.\nApparently, I haven't quit yet."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "640944"
msgid "#C236196003Gatou#CDEF. #C236196003Leo#CDEF. #C236196003Julius#CDEF. #C236196003Shinji#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "641164"
msgid "Deciding to fight now just dispelled most of my worries."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "641684"
msgid "I don't have the power to fight #C236196003BB#CDEF.\nAll I can do is offer you a\ncomfortable life here."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "642032"
msgid "The sentiment gently dispels my last doubt."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "643136"
msgid "…yeah, I'm sure of it."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "643416"
msgid "――――――."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "643564"
msgid "…that's the kind of insignificant,\ngreedy person #C236196003#FAMILY #GIVEN#CDEF is."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "643684"
msgid "―――You're… so…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "643832"
msgid "…………"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "644228"
msgid "I enter the Infirmary."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "647264"
msgid "I rested and stripped all extraneous functions―\nMy style now is all offense!\nDon't my avatar's movements look smoother?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "647688"
msgid "You look like you slept well.\nI also got plenty of rest.\nI'll have no issues with self-control."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "648512"
msgid "Ah, but, I still have one more chance!\nWhen we break down the Wall to the Core, \nI'll send a transmission from here!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "648632"
msgid "G-give me a little more time until then!\nPlease, take it slow and steady!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "648784"
msgid "Setup complete.\nUm… what… do you think…?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "649452"
msgid "Let's keep doing our best, #C236196003Sakura#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "650092"
msgid "I asked him to have you two meet up in a\nclassroom.\nIt was a huge headache for me, you know."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "650396"
msgid "Thus, regretfully, I have the Infirmary closed."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "650544"
msgid "Oh, yes.\nIf you'd like, please take this.\nIt's not much, just some supplies."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "650628"
msgid "The Labyrinth is an unknown Arena…\nPlease be very careful."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "650920"
msgid "Um… Please be careful, okay?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "651028"
msgid "Umm, #C236196003#GIVEN#CDEF.\nDoes it hurt anywhere?\nIf necessary, I can do a full body scan, or…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "651772"
msgid "Viruses won't be getting in,\nbut if some accident were to happen…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "652176"
msgid "I'm sorry. I'm doing all I can to maintain\nthe premises and support your exploration……\nso I have no free memory to spare……"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "652376"
msgid "Good morning."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "652400"
msgid "There seem to be no problems with your\nphysical and mental states. Your mind\nand body are in perfect health, #C236196003#GIVEN#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "652720"
msgid "The Relief appeared in the form of #C236196003Rin#CDEF,\nbut I wonder… is it #C236196003Rin#CDEF, herself?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "653032"
msgid "It is my sworn duty to ensure your……\nno, everyone's safety. I can't do much, \nbut I'll do everything I can to help you!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "653268"
msgid "I lent #C236196003Rin#CDEF an empty classroom."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "653324"
msgid "Like how your personal room is for you,\nit's isolated from other spaces\nso there's complete privacy."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "653444"
msgid "#C236196003Julius#CDEF is running a jamming code,\nthough it's weak."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "653524"
msgid "With this and #C236196003Julius#CDEF' skills, typical hostile\nprograms shouldn't be able to detect him."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "653808"
msgid "So you obtained the first #C000246204SG#CDEF.\nI find it very interesting that #C236196003Rani#CDEF also\nhas an #C000246204SG#CDEF…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "654068"
msgid "U-umm…\nNo, nevermind…\nYou have it rough, don't you…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "654144"
msgid "I gave the clothes to #C236196003Rin#CDEF.\nPlease get them from her."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "654240"
msgid "Whenever you obtain a new outfit, it will\nautomatically be sent to My Room."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "654372"
msgid "…ah, you need some supplies?\nUmm… it's not much but…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "654696"
msgid "I may be an AI, but I have no area of\nexpertise…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "654824"
msgid "Please don't bring it up again… it feels\nlike my trauma might turn into an #C000246204SG#CDEF…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "655480"
msgid "Um, #C236196003#GIVEN#CDEF.\nBe careful…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "655536"
msgid "Good morning."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "656292"
msgid "You, #C236196003#GIVEN#CDEF?\nI don't really think of you in that way.\nSorry…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "656412"
msgid "You, #C236196003#GIVEN#CDEF?\nRather than an older #[brother][sister]#,\nI think of you as… N-never mind!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "656544"
msgid "Good morning.\nLooks like you slept well last night."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "657252"
msgid "Until now, I assumed the Aggression Wall was\nfor repelling #C236196003BB#CDEF, so its density…\nIts mesh wasn't fine enough."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "657492"
msgid "…however, please understand that even\nallocating this many resources won't block\n#C000246204BB Channel#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "657728"
msgid "*cough*…\nNo, I'm fine.\nMy throat is just hurting a little."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "657796"
msgid "……………………………………\n……………………………………"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "657940"
msgid "P-pretend couple…!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "658088"
msgid "Good morning."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "658204"
msgid "Hey, um…\nH-here, some provisions…!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "658456"
msgid "Ah! Sorry!\nI was just looking up ways to prepare\ndelicious black tea…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "658616"
msgid "So, um…\nPlease don't worry about it too much."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "658908"
msgid "My guess is that she found the back-entrance\nto the \"now door-less\" Janitor's Closet,\nby coincidence."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "659552"
msgid "I'm happy to hear that you're worried about me.\nBut please put your own well-being first."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "660024"
msgid "Huh? Did that antacid work for you?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "660844"
msgid "Something's wrong with #C236196003BB#CDEF……?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "661124"
msgid "Hacking is a skill for exposing\n#RUBSa person's#RUBEan AI's#REND private information, anyway!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "661224"
msgid "Right…?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "661240"
msgid "Leave the rest to us.\nPlease go get some rest in My Room, #C236196003#GIVEN#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "661588"
msgid "What's the matter? Can't sleep, maybe?\nI have some nice herbal tea if that's the case."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "661680"
msgid "………u-umm…… Senpai………"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "661796"
msgid "P-pretty strange, isn't it?\nI… I wonder what's the matter with me."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "661864"
msgid "I-I'm sorry!\nI'll be performing a full maintenance on myself,\nso we can talk later… is that okay?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "662100"
msgid "…oh, yes. I still haven't given you today's\nprovisions. Here, please take this."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "662292"
msgid "Luckily nothing happened on the sixteenth floor,\nbut that also means we didn't collect\nany data on #C236196003Meltlilith#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "662892"
msgid "You're #C000246204in the Far Side of the Moon#CDEF,\nwhere #C236196003BB#CDEF was born;\nwhere the #C000246204Alter Egos#CDEF were born―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "663052"
msgid "It's all my fault.\nYet, you don't hate anyone or place any blame."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "663620"
msgid "#C236196003#SVT#CDEF's primordial power……\nThat certainly may be able to compete with #C236196003BB#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "663728"
msgid "But will #C236196003Jinako#CDEF be willing to help us out?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "663864"
msgid "Still, leaping to face #C236196003BB#CDEF without\nany plan is nothing short of suicide."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "664008"
msgid "Hehe… That's just like you, #C236196003#GIVEN#CDEF.\nHere you go, please take it."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "664092"
msgid "I'm happy to still be of some use.\nPlease stay strong and healthy."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "664312"
msgid "But I'm happy to hear this!\nActually, I was hoping this would happen――\nSo I went all out to make THIS!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "664868"
msgid "Ah. Those are the clothes I made\nfor #C236196003#SVT#CDEF, right?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "664936"
msgid "Hehe. I'm glad to see them being used.\nThey really do suit #C236196003#SVT#CDEF a lot better."
msgstr ""

