#. popupStd_line2
msgctxt "833516"
msgid "#TVAL02 Sm#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. unk_op1659
msgctxt "833536"
msgid "　You cannot carry any more\n#C000246204#TITM0001#CDEF."
msgstr "　Você não pode carregar mais\n#C000246204#TITM0001#CDEF."

#. unk_op1650
msgctxt "833592"
msgid "You may now save your current game data\n            as #C000246204Clear Data#CDEF."
msgstr "Agora você pode salvar seus dados\n         como #C000246204Clear Data#CDEF."

#. unk_op1650
msgctxt "833676"
msgid "     You may use this data to carry\nover elements to the start of a new game."
msgstr "     Você pode usar esses dados para levar\nelementos ao início de um novo jogo."

#. unk_op1650
msgctxt "833756"
msgid "Please be careful to not overwrite\n  the data while you are saving."
msgstr "Tome cuidado para não sobrescrever\n  os dados ao salvar."

#. unk_op1653
msgctxt "833824"
msgid "Would you like to save your Clear Data?"
msgstr "Deseja salvar seus Clear Data?"

#. popupSaveBeforeQuit_line1
msgctxt "833864"
msgid "Are you sure you wish to exit"
msgstr "Tem certeza de que deseja sair"

#. popupSaveBeforeQuit_line2
msgctxt "833896"
msgid "without saving the Clear Data?"
msgstr "sem salvar os Clear Data?"

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "833928"
msgid "The shelf has a neatly lined-up tea set.\nPlaces like these are where #C236196003Sakura#CDEF's personality seem to\nreally show."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "834056"
msgid "It's a refrigerator.\nSince I'm quite parched, I open the door to search for a drink."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "834144"
msgid "An old model laptop is laying on the desk,\nbut there are no signs of it being used."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "834228"
msgid "Of course, I don't expect an advanced AI like #C236196003Sakura#CDEF\nto have any need for such an old device."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "834340"
msgid "It's an instrument for measuring your height and weight.\nI don't need to use it."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "834424"
msgid "This instrument is for measuring your height."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "834472"
msgid "I considered measuring my height,\nuntil I noticed it's the kind that also measures your weight."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "834568"
msgid "What are these \"herbs,\" anyway?\nThere are tons of different kinds with different properties.\nLumping them all into \"herb\"\nwithout specifying what they are or what they do\ndoes NOT give me a good reason to use them."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "834784"
msgid "Various medicines are arranged here.\nHandling these without any medical knowledge is very dangerous.\nI'll leave them be."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "834908"
msgid "These are neatly covered with pure-white sheets.\nThis level of professionalism would put even a\nhigh-class hotel to shame."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "835032"
msgid "After I mention this to #C236196003Sakura#CDEF,\nshe goes beet-red with embarrassment."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "835120"
msgid "I figured she would ask me this at some point."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "835168"
msgid "#C236196003Rin#CDEF and #C236196003Rani#CDEF say nothing about my judgement to me.\nBut #C236196003Sakura#CDEF is a different story."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "835300"
msgid "#C236196003Sakura#CDEF looks away, slightly embarrassed."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "835360"
msgid "#C236196003Meltlilith#CDEF said that she likes me.\nShe did all of those things because she likes me."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "835464"
msgid "Maybe this #C236196003Sakura#CDEF here understands where she's coming from."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "835540"
msgid "#C236196003Sakura#CDEF looks away, slightly embarrassed."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "835600"
msgid "#C236196003Meltlilith#CDEF said that she likes #C236196003Archer#CDEF.\nShe did all of those things because she likes him."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "835724"
msgid "Maybe this #C236196003Sakura#CDEF here understands where she's coming from."
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "835800"
msgid "I don't think so."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "835820"
msgid "#C236196003Sakura#CDEF's eyes widen, and she's at a loss for words."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "835888"
msgid "The short, actually, very long silence eventually breaks."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "835948"
msgid "Erm, this is odd.\nI thought I wouldn't like the idea\nof being lumped together with them, but…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "836044"
msgid "I feel relieved.\nIn any case, I'm happy to hear that."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "836100"
msgid "She is who she is, I am who I am.\nI'll support you until the very end.\nI'll do my best!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "836188"
msgid "#C236196003Sakura#CDEF, I wish to speak with you in private."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "836252"
msgid "Praetor. Please wait in the\ncorner of the room for us to finish.\nDon't move a muscle until I tell you to."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "836360"
msgid "…ahem.\nThere's only one thing to ask about:\nThe Psycho Dive."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "836424"
msgid "I'm not particularly afraid or anything,\njust a little uneasy.\nI'll be consulting you on it."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "836520"
msgid "I could tell where the Presi…\n#C236196003#GIVEN#CDEF was inside of me,\nbut it was mysterious, a new feeling…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "836632"
msgid "It felt like heat from a different source\nthan myself was racing through my nerves.\nIt was warm."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "836732"
msgid "But, um… It felt like\nevery inch of my body was being looked at…\nEmbarrassment is one thing I felt plenty of…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "836848"
msgid "T-that certainly is embarrassing!\nI learned much from this!\nYou have my thanks, #C236196003Sakura#CDEF!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "836952"
msgid "…ahem. Now then, my Praetor,\nlooking so glum up against that wall."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "837020"
msgid "For no particular reason,\nI'm going to go take a little bath.\nWait for me here until I finish."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "837116"
msgid "#C236196003Sakura#CDEF? Do you have a moment to spare?\nI have a brief thing I would like to speak\nto you about in private."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "837240"
msgid "Ah, please go sit in that chair there, Darling.\nCount cherry petals in the schoolyard. Be like,\n\"aren't cherry trees in bloom so romantic?\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "837380"
msgid "…okay. There's only one topic to discuss:\nThe experience of your mental dive, please."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "837468"
msgid "As you can imagine, I kind of don't have \nexperience with having my mind… or rather,\nmy body adventured in."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "837580"
msgid "What does it feel like? Does it actually hurt?\nIf it does, in what way? Like a cavity\nor a headache, something of that nature?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "837708"
msgid "This level of exposure\nis right up #C236196003Tamamo#CDEF's alley."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "837776"
msgid "Now then, that's enough of our secret talk.\nDid I keep you waiting, Darling?\nOkay, let's go full speed ahead!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "837888"
msgid "Yeah. Although I'll be dormant during the dive,\nmy immune functions will still be working.\nDon't take detours, go straight for the goal."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "838028"
msgid "Fool. Don't speak as if your Spiritron makeup\nis anything equivalent to mine."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "838108"
msgid "My flesh possesses the supreme Golden Rule.\nIt's the finest work of art on this entire\ncelestial body."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "838212"
msgid "To one who is ordinary, every part of me\nis a perilous poison. Go forth steeled,\nand try not to become charmed."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "838324"
msgid "I called out to #C236196003Sakura#CDEF as I went to hand over\nthe Classic Sailor Uniform I got a hold of."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "838432"
msgid "……but just as she turned around,\nI got a little nervous,\nwondering if I was just being presumptuous."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "838536"
msgid "No, no, no, it would be a complete waste to stop now.\n#[It's not like I'm going to wear a girl's uniform, anyways.][I don't need a second set of the same uniform anyway.]#"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "838708"
msgid "I grasped the folded uniform tightly,\nresolved myself,\nand thrust the uniform in front of #C236196003Sakura#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "838824"
msgid "\"I know this is sudden,\n but #[please take this][take this]#, #C236196003Sakura#CDEF!\""
msgstr ""

#. unk_op1659
msgctxt "838912"
msgid "　Handed over the\n#C245150095#TITM0001#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "838960"
msgid "Since #C236196003Sakura#CDEF's an ally helping us escape from\nthe Far Side of the Moon,\nI absolutely want her to wear this uniform too."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "839096"
msgid "Please return it to #C236196003Father Kotomine#CDEF at once,\nand buy something else with it.\nLike a recovery item, or a Mystic Code!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "839232"
msgid "It hurts to have #C236196003Sakura#CDEF reject it so profusely.\nI did expect her to be confused by it,\nbut I didn't expect her to say \"No.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "839372"
msgid "Ah… T-that's not it…… I just meant\nthat we should keep an order of priorities\nbased on the situation…… so……"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "839488"
msgid "I don't want to inconvenience you, #C236196003#GIVEN#CDEF.\nSo it's not as if I don't like it,\nor anything like that."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "839608"
msgid "I look up and say \"In that case……\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "839648"
msgid "\"If you're really not opposed to the uniform, then――\n as an ally of the Student Council,\n and an ally who supports #C236196003#FAMILY #GIVEN#CDEF,\n I definitely want you to wear it.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "839836"
msgid "\"It'll definitely look good on you, #C236196003Sakura#CDEF.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "839900"
msgid "………you're a curious person, #C236196003#GIVEN#CDEF.\nNo one else seems to mind things like this."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "840000"
msgid "……I understand. Since I need to change,\nwill you accompany me to the Infirmary?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "840084"
msgid "I left the Student Council Room along with #C236196003Sakura#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "840152"
msgid "What is it that you need?\n………wha――? You're giving me a uniform?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "840224"
msgid "I am very grateful for your consideration,\nbut I cannot accept this\nunder the current circumstances."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "840328"
msgid "This Sm belongs to #C236196003#GIVEN#CDEF……\nSo please put it towards\nexploring the Labyrinth instead."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "840432"
msgid "……I know what #C236196003Sakura#CDEF just said isn't wrong.\nIf I didn't go out of my way to prepare this uniform,\nI wouldn't have run into as many issues as I have."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "840600"
msgid "I did want to see #C236196003Sakura#CDEF in the classic school uniform,\nbut I should give up on this for now."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "840712"
msgid "She usually turns her head and gives me a smile,\nbut she was gazing somewhere far off, looking depressed.\nIt seems as if she hasn't noticed me."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "840856"
msgid "Growing concerned, I try calling out to her again."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "840908"
msgid "It's rare for the hard working #C236196003Sakura#CDEF to be so sluggish."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "840984"
msgid "Which reminds me, when I was diving into #C236196003Rin#CDEF's\nLabyrinth Core, #C236196003Sakura#CDEF helped me out as well.\nCould that have been really taxing on her…?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "841156"
msgid "No structural defects exist\nin AI who are products of the #C000246204Moon Cell#CDEF.\nHowever, #C236196003BB#CDEF appeared――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "841284"
msgid "…I see. #C236196003Sakura#CDEF and #C236196003BB#CDEF are identical models.\nIf #C236196003BB#CDEF did go rogue, that means it could happen with #C236196003Sakura#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "841456"
msgid "For humans, no one could use \"because they're human\" as\na reason to say that another person and I are the exact same.\nFor those two AI, it's different."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "841608"
msgid "No matter how different they are on the inside,\nas long as they were made from the same design,\nthe same outcome would be possible for both…\nShe must've realized that."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "841780"
msgid "But this really isn't something she needs to worry about.\nThe cause for her going rogue is most likely a bug, anyway."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "841900"
msgid "As a comrade in the Student Council, as our ally,\n#C236196003Sakura#CDEF is protecting the health of everyone in this school."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "842028"
msgid "In our last meeting,\neveryone must have confirmed as much."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "842088"
msgid "Yes. I was truly happy\nafter hearing everyone's words back then."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "842156"
msgid "…but I can't ignore the chance of a defect\nlying within me as much as you all trust me.\nI can't say for sure that a bug won't appear."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "842292"
msgid "When I think about how, by some catalyst,\nI may end up like #C236196003BB#CDEF, I wonder if staying here\nis the right choice or―aahh!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "842428"
msgid "I aim for the defenseless #C236196003Sakura#CDEF's forehead,\nand let loose a light karate chop."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "842524"
msgid "A critical hit! Sakura has been stunned!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "842568"
msgid "Supposing that #C236196003Sakura#CDEF doesn't trust herself, everyone else DOES.\nBefore thinking about the \"worst case scenario,\"\nI want her to turn to the words of her comrades."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "842748"
msgid "Plus, if #C236196003Sakura#CDEF were to ever go rogue like #C236196003BB#CDEF,\n#C236196003#FAMILY #GIVEN#CDEF would do\neverything in #[his][her]# power to stop #C236196003Sakura#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "842932"
msgid "I spoke pridefully to my kouhai,\n\"I'll karate chop you over the brow until you cry,\n so don't worry so much.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "843044"
msgid "…yes, you're right. I have everyone by\nmy side, and #C236196003#GIVEN#CDEF even comes to visit me\nto see how I'm doing, like now――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "843180"
msgid "I won't make mistakes.\nI don't expect them to happen.\nI won't become #C236196003BB#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "843272"
msgid "I put my strength into a solid nod at #C236196003Sakura#CDEF's question."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "843348"
msgid "#C236196003Leo#CDEF, #C236196003Rin#CDEF, and I won't let that happen.\nSo… someway, somehow, I want her to feel at ease."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "843472"
msgid "…yes! To make sure the trust\neveryone's put in me won't be in vain,\nI'll keep trying my very, very best."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "843580"
msgid "Yeah. Now that that's settled, I can't be\nstanding here daydreaming. I have to return to\nthe Student Council Room now. Yes."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "843704"
msgid "I had #C236196003#SVT[Saber][Archer][Caster][Gilgamesh]##CDEF wait in the classroom because\n#SVT[she][he][she][he]# was a little hard on the eyes… erm,\n#SVT[she][he][she][he]# looks different from what you're used to."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "843924"
msgid "Waking up from a long sleep is mentally\ndraining enough for you, so I had them wait\nsomewhere else."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "844024"
msgid "…um.\nAnyway, please don't be surprised, okay?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "844072"
msgid "About #C236196003Gilgamesh#CDEF―― He was looking all around\nthe old school building and\nwouldn't listen to me at all――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "844196"
msgid "Y-you're asking about money?\nI'm sorry. I wish to help you in\nas many ways as I can, but……"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "844292"
msgid "The #C000246204Moon Cell#CDEF does not pay any wages.\nThus I am, one could say, penniless…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "844384"
msgid "And the Labyrinth's value of currency……\nits excess memory is different than what's\non the Near Side of the Moon."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "844500"
msgid "I wonder what it is about the name \"Sakurament.\"\nFor some reason, it feels incredibly malicious!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "844600"
msgid "Um, how about collecting some locally?\nM-manual labor is a wonderful thing, you know?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "844688"
msgid "You want to know where #C236196003Shinji#CDEF is?\nUmm, please give me a second to look him up."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "844784"
msgid "…huh? He's not in the hallways.\nThere's two signals in the Janitor's Closet…\nBut isn't that where #C236196003Jinako#CDEF is?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "844912"
msgid "I'll be assisting everyone from here on out.\nSpecifically, as an OS that executes and\nsupports #C236196003President Leo#CDEF's operations."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "845052"
msgid "Currently, I'm using root to also serve as\nthe main CPU that makes up the old\nschool building."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "845148"
msgid "In case of an emergency, I'll open the\nInfirmary right back up if anyone needs it.\nSo please don't worry."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "845256"
msgid "As a health management AI, I'm against\nyou entering the cherry blossom tree, but…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "845340"
msgid "Hee hee, I'm a pretty lousy nurse.\nI ended up concluding that you're all making\nthe right decision."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "845440"
msgid "I won't cut any corners while supporting you.\nI'll do my best to try and be as\nhelpful to everyone as possible."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "845552"
msgid "How did you like My Room?\nIf anything inconveniences you,\nplease tell me, okay?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "845632"
msgid "Me? No issues in the slightest.\nThis boost to my analytic functions actually\nhas me feeling in tip-top shape!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "845744"
msgid "Asking about my destabilized emotional values?\nThank you for your concern."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "845820"
msgid "But there's no need to worry.\nSince my optimization program is running,\nI'll adapt to the changes soon enough."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "845932"
msgid "When we're installing new software,\nthis sort of thing happens more often\nthan you'd think."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "846024"
msgid "You want to know about #C236196003Jinako#CDEF? As far\nas I know, she hasn't taken a single step\noutside of the Janitor's Closet."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "846156"
msgid "So I don't have any new information on her.\nMy apologies……"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "846220"
msgid "How did it go with #C236196003Jinako#CDEF?\n*sigh*… She really won't leave the\nJanitor's Closet, will she…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "846328"
msgid "The custodial room is similar to My Room for\nyou, #C236196003#GIVEN#CDEF. But since it's in an\nalmost offline state, I worry a little."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "846464"
msgid "To think such a large wall could exist…\nthis would never happen on the Near Side…\nso what's going on with this Labyrinth…?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "846592"
msgid "And, umm……\nIt's a lot more, organic and――\nbizarre, than it needs to be……"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "846672"
msgid "Wha―― You're going inside the Relief?\nThat's unknown territory.\nIs this really going to be okay…?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "846776"
msgid "……no. Even if safety isn't guaranteed,\nthis is not a situation where we can afford\nto let that stop us. Isn't that right?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "846900"
msgid "…you need to quickly ask about #C236196003Kiara#CDEF's plan…\nThis is an important task, so I will not\nallow you to fail!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "847024"
msgid "However, #C236196003Gatou#CDEF has nothing with him. I can't\nscan the entirety of the Labyrinth, so I'm\nworried…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "847140"
msgid "Anyway, rescuing #C236196003Gatou#CDEF is our highest priority\nright now."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "847216"
msgid "#C236196003#SVT#CDEF's previous outfit… There should be\nsome material on it around here… Hehe.\nI'm starting to feel a little excited."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "847352"
msgid "Good morning.\nIt looks like there's no meeting this morning."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "847416"
msgid "Sorry, I wasn't able to prepare anything else.\nPlease be careful during your search."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "847504"
msgid "#C236196003#GIVEN#CDEF, if you ever feel tired,\nthen please take a break.\nHow about having some tea?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "847608"
msgid "It would be nice to know what #C236196003Rani#CDEF likes…\nBut I don't currently have any data\non her to infer from."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "847728"
msgid "Regardless, I can't believe I was the fastest\nto lose among us… I'm a disgrace as an AI…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "847820"
msgid "Ahahaha. #C236196003Jinako#CDEF is a little cruel, huh?\nEven though she's our enemy this time around,\nI sympathize with #C236196003Rani#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "847964"
msgid "If I were #C236196003Rani#CDEF, I'd direct the school's\ntrash disposal towards the Janitor's Closet\nand do everything I could to open it up鷙"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "848108"
msgid "I can still confirm signs of Masters and\nNPCs within the Relief."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "848176"
msgid "I'm unable to measure the Relief's interior, but\nthere's no mistake that we must win against #C236196003Rani#CDEF\nin battle to free them."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "848316"
msgid "#C236196003#GIVEN#CDEF, we're counting on you!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "848364"
msgid "Hurry, #C000246204go before the Relief#CDEF. We'll also be\nadvancing our setup for the #RUBS     spiral #RUBEdepth descent#REND…!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "848496"
msgid "I was a bit overloaded\nand my processing speed fell,\nso I had taken a break in the Infirmary."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "848592"
msgid "Ah, I'm fine now. I'm able to exhibit\n100% performance, so please don't worry\nabout a thing."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "848688"
msgid "I'm fine now. I'm operating completely normally.\nPlease leave the backup to me!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "848768"
msgid "#C000246204Alter Egos#CDEF are beings born from rogue AI.\nThe likelihood of their basic structures\nbeing malfunctioned are high."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "848900"
msgid "Thus, even if they appear normal at a glance,\nplease don't ever let your guard down.\n…these girls are obstacles we must defeat."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "849032"
msgid "There are others with the same model as me,\nbut I have no \"sister\" machines."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "849112"
msgid "But when I'm looking at #C236196003Rin#CDEF, I sometimes\nimagine… if this is what having\nan older sister is like."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "849228"
msgid "Although it's unclear as to why I feel that way.\nMaybe the cause is because #C236196003Rin#CDEF is so caring\nthat I started to depend on her?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "849372"
msgid "I can tell by looking at your face, I don't\neven need to scan it. I AM an apprentice\nin health management AI, after all."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "849496"
msgid "Of course, I didn't forget about\nbringing supplies! Okay, please take this."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "849572"
msgid "The Student Council can back you up physically,\nbut we can't give care for mental fatigue.\nPlease take care of your body."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "849696"
msgid "#C000246204Masochistic Constitution#CDEF…\nA constitution that inclines one towards\nacts of torment after seeing her, huh…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "849820"
msgid "…it doesn't make much sense to me.\nI wonder why #C236196003BB#CDEF would add that sort of\ndefect to her own offshoot…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "849940"
msgid "…my assumptions were too optimistic.\nNow I'm going to tighten the entrance's\nsecurity up more than ever."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "850048"
msgid "Even if #C236196003BB#CDEF herself tried, I won't let\nanyone invade this old school."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "850136"
msgid "But I raised the density due to this incident.\nEven if an enemy were kitten-sized, anything,\nincluding their body, would be repelled back."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "850276"
msgid "It involves signals rather than a body, and\nwhile we're within the #C000246204Moon Cell#CDEF, the Spiritron\nNetwork can't be cut even if we wanted to…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "850428"
msgid "………ah… I-I'm sorry.\nI was a little out of it.\nIs there something I can do for you?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "850516"
msgid "…sorry, I lost myself for a second there.\nWell, two people is safer than one… I wasn't\nsurprised or anything, okay?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "850636"
msgid "Sorry for making you worry yesterday.\nI took my time debugging overnight,\nnow I'm up and ready to go!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "850740"
msgid "About your memories…\nUm, I know everyone is having a hard time\nright now, but keep being careful…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "850840"
msgid "It's going to be okay, #C236196003#GIVEN#CDEF.\nWe'll definitely get back the memories\nyou still don't have yet, soon."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "850960"
msgid "Black tea, black tea…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "850984"
msgid "With or without your memories,\nI think that it doesn't change\nwho you are, Senpai."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "851068"
msgid "I spoke to just about every Master during\nthe 1st Round of the #C000246204Holy Grail War#CDEF,\nbut I never got to speak with #C236196003Jinako#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "851220"
msgid "She was confined in the Janitor's Closet the\nentire time. That door transforms into the\nArena's entrance after the preliminaries end."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "851356"
msgid "…we're almost there, aren't we?\nThis will all be over soon."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "851420"
msgid "#C236196003#GIVEN#CDEF, we're counting on you.\nLet's escape from the Labyrinth this time,\nfor sure. That will lead to #C236196003BB#CDEF's deletion."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "851572"
msgid "Black tea mixed with coffee, plus sugar and\nmilk. That's an extra order I got from #C236196003Kotomine#CDEF.\nOh! And the lemon!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "851700"
msgid "He'll be in tip-top shape to provide\nbackup on his side!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "851760"
msgid "#C236196003#GIVEN#CDEF, you seem tired.\nPlease go back to your My Room\nand have yourself a long rest."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "851864"
msgid "I still have plenty of medicine, so please\nlet me know if you run out. It may only serve\nas a small solace, but…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "851980"
msgid "You're always acting reckless, after all,\n#C236196003#GIVEN#CDEF. Please be sure to rest\nwhen it's time for a break."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "852100"
msgid "Um, this might… not help wash away the taste,\nbut I tried making a bento for you.\nPlease eat it if you'd like."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "852212"
msgid "I hope it's to your liking…\nI'll be making lots more so I can hand out\nsome to #C236196003Rin#CDEF and #C236196003Rani#CDEF next."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "852344"
msgid "Doing things like exchanging bentos will\ndefinitely liven up the place."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "852416"
msgid "I thought all it would do is put your mind at\nease, but it worked better than I\nthought it would. I'm glad."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "852524"
msgid "#C236196003Rin#CDEF and #C236196003Rani#CDEF temporarily froze #C236196003Sakura#CDEF's body.\nThe encroachment is being suppressed for now,\nbut we don't know how long it'll hold."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "852704"
msgid "I have to go see #C236196003Kiara#CDEF and figure out a way to solve this…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "852780"
msgid "#C236196003Rin#CDEF and #C236196003Rani#CDEF temporarily froze #C236196003Sakura#CDEF's body.\nThe encroachment is being suppressed for now,\nbut we don't know how long it'll hold."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "852960"
msgid "Let's go after #C236196003Kiara#CDEF.\nIf she's going to be anywhere,\nmaybe she'll be around the deepest part of the\nSakura Labyrinth?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "853096"
msgid "#C236196003Rin#CDEF and #C236196003Rani#CDEF temporarily froze #C236196003Sakura#CDEF's body.\nThe encroachment is being suppressed for now,\nbut we don't know how long it'll hold."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "853276"
msgid "Let's enter #C236196003Sakura#CDEF's subconscious and\ncut out the bits eating away at her."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "853368"
msgid "Well of course. She's an AI gone rogue.\nShe seems logical, but she's holding on to\nchronic #RUBS    lag #RUBEemotions#REND."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "853492"
msgid "Things normal AIs would consider as fluctuating\nand cut out, she holds on to forever…. \nFrom the start, something was wrong with her."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "853628"
msgid "…s-sorry…\nI find it difficult to speak when I look\nyou in the eyes now, Senpai…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "853712"
msgid "I'm not sure how to put this… I don't know\nthe reason why, but my chest feels warm."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "853800"
msgid "Leave the rest to us.\nPlease go get some rest in My Room, Senpai."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "853868"
msgid "I'll take charge of getting #C236196003Rin#CDEF and #C236196003Rani#CDEF\nto rest before they grow exhausted.\nPlease let me take care of things!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "854012"
msgid "Huh? Why are you laughing?\n\"I'm pretty dependable, oddly enough\"?\nY-you think so?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "854096"
msgid "Welcome back. Did you forget something?\nWe have our system to back you up all set to go."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "854188"
msgid "To also double as thanks for saving me from the\nMelt Virus earlier, I put in a little extra\neffort! Please use it on your companion."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "854324"
msgid "#C236196003Rin#CDEF and #C236196003Rani#CDEF are trying their hardest,\nbut please be very careful in the Labyrinth,\nokay?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "854448"
msgid "…there's less than a 10% chance of success,\nbut we have to do it."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "854516"
msgid "Even after the building's power shuts off,\nI'll be able to handle your Navi on my own,\n#C236196003#GIVEN#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "854628"
msgid "I can only do so much, but please let me\nhelp you until the end.\nIt's also my duty to do so."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "854724"
msgid "Exploring the eighteenth floor comes first, yes?\nLet's not get distracted by the #C000246204Moon Cell#CDEF's\nCore, lest we ignore what's before us."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "854872"
msgid "…I want to step up in turn.\nNo matter what happens on the final floor,\nI'll definitely protect you, Senpai…!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "854984"
msgid "I know I did something unforgivable, but…\nI want to do my best for you,\nof my own volition――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "855080"
msgid "I have no more hesitation."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "855108"
msgid "If you choose the #C000246204Holy Grail War#CDEF, where you\nmight perish, over this tranquil yet\nempty old school building, then――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "855244"
msgid "A way to disable the #C000246204Ten Crowns#CDEF――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "855296"
msgid "Until we find a way, I won't open my Relief\nfor you. Please think of it as the bare\nminimum before facing #C236196003BB#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "855424"
msgid "If we can do it, then I also want\neveryone to return to the normal world."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "855500"
msgid "…huh?\nYou'd like some supplies for tomorrow, you say?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "855556"
msgid "…huh?\nYou say the last thing you want is to have some\nof my bento? And you'll pay handsomely?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "855652"
msgid "…oh, you. In terms of healing,\nelixirs are more effective and\nefficient, though."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "855736"
msgid "Hee hee… I was planning on giving you some\nregardless if you pleaded me or not. I've been\ngiving out supplies for a long time."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "855864"
msgid "Senpai, please stay safe tomorrow.\nGet plenty of rest tonight and clear your mind."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "855948"
msgid "Tomorrow is when we finally reach the\n#C000246204Moon Cell's Core#CDEF. Please get plenty\nof rest tonight."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "856056"
msgid "Those clothes… That's the uniform from\nback in the #C000246204Holy Grail War#CDEF, isn't it?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "856152"
msgid "It couldn't have been that long ago,\nbut I feel very nostalgic looking at those."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "856236"
msgid "Changing clothes every now and then makes\nfor a nice change of pace, doesn't it?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "856320"
msgid "…….stable brain waves, confirmed.\nAlpha waves, beta waves - normal.\n#[He's][She's]# waking up."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "856420"
msgid "It looks like…… an infirmary."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "856452"
msgid "I'm lying on a bed right now.\nBeside me is a girl in a white robe checking up on me."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "856540"
msgid "I think her name was……\nThat's right, her name was #C236196003Sakura#CDEF.\nAn AI in charge of managing the health of #C000246204Masters#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "856684"
msgid "I don't really understand what's going on yet,\nbut it seems #C236196003Sakura#CDEF has been taking care of me."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "856796"
msgid "……you've been in your sleeping state\nfor longer than anyone else.\nIn any case, I'm glad you're awake."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "856900"
msgid "Your Avatar may still feel sluggish,\nbut it'll soon return to its original state.\nYou should be able to walk around soon."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "857024"
msgid "#C236196003Sakura#CDEF gave me a smile full of joy\nand relief from the bottom of her heart."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "857116"
msgid "I can't help but let my tension go.\nI feel like I just had some sort of nightmare,\nbut that smile alone blew all of my anxieties away."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "857252"
msgid "……but no.\nI can't just stare at #C236196003Sakura#CDEF's beautiful smile forever."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "857336"
msgid "Your questions are understandable.\nBut before that,\nallow me to confirm a few things."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "857424"
msgid "Do I know who I am?\nI don't need to think too hard for that one."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "857492"
msgid "#[I am][My name is]# #C236196003#FAMILY #GIVEN#CDEF.\nA student attending Tsukumihara Academy――but not quite."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "857604"
msgid "So, can you tell me what a #ROFS0001#RUBS  Magus#RUBE#C000246204Wizard#CDEF#REND is?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "857692"
msgid "……I wonder why #C236196003Sakura#CDEF's asking.\nIsn't that considered the most basic of basics?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "857792"
msgid "The Body is something that grounds the Soul.\nSo if the Body and Soul could be differentiated\n―――wouldn't it be possible to send it elsewhere?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "857940"
msgid "That's correct. In an era where magic has\nceased to be, they are the only ones\nwho've inherited the theories of magic."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "858060"
msgid "By the way―――\nCan you tell me what year it is,\nand where we are right now?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "858140"
msgid "You don't even need to ask. It's the year 2030 AD.\nHuman technological advancement froze in the 1970s.\nThat's also when the Western European Plutocracy\nabolished the development of space travel."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "858336"
msgid "As for the question of 'where'……\nI don't really know the details, but I know enough."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "858424"
msgid "The [#C000246204Holy Grail#CDEF] that sleeps in the seas of the heavens,\nthat the #RUBS   Magi#RUBE#C000246204Wizards#REND#CDEF of the Earth dream of."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "858576"
msgid "The #REND#C000246204Moon Cell Automaton#CDEF has no will of its own,\nyou could call it a huge computational device."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "858692"
msgid "Put simply, it's a supercomputer the size of the Moon.\nEven all of the computers in the world combined\nwouldn't be able to compete with the #C000246204Moon Cell#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "858860"
msgid "#RUBS   Magi#RUBE#C000246204Wizards#REND#CDEF that have reached the Moon compete against one another,\nwith the last one standing invited into the #C000246204Moon Cell's Core#CDEF\nand is given the right to use it."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "859076"
msgid "That is the #C000246204Holy Grail#CDEF―――\nan almighty calculator with #RUBS              power source#RUBEthe computational ability#REND\nequivalent to a solar system."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "859248"
msgid "That's right. #C000246204Masters#CDEF like you came to\nthe #C000246204Moon Cell#CDEF for the #C000246204Holy Grail#CDEF.\nThat is the #C000246204Holy Grail War#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "859416"
msgid "As a means to do that, the #C000246204Moon Cell#CDEF\ngave you all a proxy to do battle with.\nWhat was it called?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "859532"
msgid "Something to fight with.\nSomething vital to a #ROFS0001#RUBS  Magus#RUBE#C000246204Wizard#CDEF#REND, a partner to fight alongside."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "859664"
msgid "……that's right, I remember now."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "859700"
msgid "For making it through the preliminaries\nand qualifying in the #C000246204Holy Grail War#CDEF,\nthe #C000246204Moon Cell#CDEF gave me #C000246204Command Seals#CDEF and…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "859868"
msgid "A Servant――\nA reproduction of a hero from the past as a familiar――\nto contract with, as a participating Master…… I think――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "860000"
msgid "So there's no issues up 'til there.\nN-now then…… I, need to ask you,\nthe most important thing."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "860100"
msgid "The thing is… #C236196003#GIVEN#CDEF,\ndo you remember anything that happened\nduring the #C000246204Holy Grail War#CDEF?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "860224"
msgid "Well yeah, of course I do―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "860256"
msgid "I know that I'm a #ROFS0001#RUBS  Magus#RUBE#C000246204Wizard#CDEF#REND, but I don't remember\na single thing about #C236196003#FAMILY #GIVEN#CDEF's past at all!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "860420"
msgid "Actually, #[why][for what reason]# am I even participating\nin such a dangerous war to begin with!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "860520"
msgid "I thought so… just like everyone else.\nYou can remember who you are, but nothing\nabout during the #C000246204Holy Grail War#CDEF……"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "860656"
msgid "Calm down and listen to me, #C236196003#GIVEN#CDEF.\nYou're only in a state of memory loss where\nall you remember is that \"You are a Master.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "860800"
msgid "I don't really feel anything about that,\nbut fact is it's just as #C236196003Sakura#CDEF said,\nthe only thing I can remember is that \"I am a Master.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "860952"
msgid "……that just a bit ago,\nI was an \"ordinary high school student\"\ngoing to a school different from this one."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "861060"
msgid "That it was swallowed up by an unknown darkness."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "861112"
msgid "From how you've been speaking, #C236196003#GIVEN#CDEF,\nyou might've been reset to how you were\nat the start of the #C000246204Holy Grail War#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "861260"
msgid "Since you've been in a comatose state\nfor so long, it's possible you really\nonly remember your own name……"
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "861368"
msgid "Head of the Infirmary"
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "861392"
msgid "Sakura Matou"
msgstr "Matou Sakura"

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "861408"
msgid "……I don't really understand why,\nbut that's really shocking……"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "861476"
msgid "……? There's no need to be sad\nabout a correct answer, #[I think……][right……?]#"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "861560"
msgid "Oh, I'm not related to #C236196003Shinji Matou#CDEF at all.\nMy surname is randomly chosen from\nthe participants of the given #C000246204Holy Grail War#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "861720"
msgid "With the 'ding' of a lightbulb.\nNo doubt about it, her name is #C236196003Francis Xavier#CDEF……!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "861820"
msgid "Whaaat……!?\nRegardless of the correct answer, why did even I think that!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "861896"
msgid "Despite how I look, I'm a health management AI.\nThe scan I performed on you\nwas especially thorough, #C236196003#GIVEN#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "862024"
msgid "#C236196003#GIVEN#CDEF, you usually play things cool, but\neven when you joke around or talk in circles,\nyou can still generally read the mood."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "862168"
msgid "So, in times like these, may you please\nkeep the clowning around to a minimum?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "862248"
msgid "My administrative authority over the Infirmary\ngrants me access to unspeakable punishments\nfor me to use at will."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "862364"
msgid "……sure, joking around in a serious situation\ncould mean life or death.\nI guess I just got reprimanded by #C236196003Sakura#CDEF……"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "862500"
msgid "Ahem. At any rate, we've moved pretty quickly,\nbut you've gotten yourself a initial look\nat the situation, #C236196003#GIVEN#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "862632"
msgid "This is as much as I can do for you now.\n…I would like to help you further,\nbut I have no help left to give."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "862744"
msgid "Like everyone else, my record browsing\nfunctions have been locked… I'm really sorry."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "862832"
msgid "#C236196003Sakura#CDEF bows remorsefully, rises from her chair,\nthen moves towards a corner of the room."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "862940"
msgid "Hello, this is the Infirmary.\n#C236196003#GIVEN#CDEF has woken up. Neither #[his][her]# mind\nor body show any abnormalities."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "863068"
msgid "That's good to hear. Well, I know \nthis is sudden, but please let #[him][her]# know\nI'd like #[him][her]# to come by."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "863188"
msgid "Um… Since #C236196003#GIVEN#CDEF has only just woken up,\nperhaps just a greeting would be…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "863284"
msgid "I apologize,\nbut there is no room for relaxation.\nWe're racing against time here."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "863368"
msgid "Besides, knowing #[him, he'll][her, she'll]# go on a stroll\nregardless of what I say."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "863456"
msgid "#[He'll][She'll]# start exploring now that #[he's][she's]# awake.\nTell #[him][her]# that after #C000246204inspecting this new, old\nschool#CDEF, to come to the #C000246204Student Council Room#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "863656"
msgid "…#C236196003Sakura#CDEF's transmission with that person ends."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "863720"
msgid "\"Come to the Student Council Room,\"\nit sounds like…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "863776"
msgid "Um…\nDid you hear that transmission just now?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "863824"
msgid "The way that person was speaking annoyed me,\nbut I do need to get moving now that I'm awake."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "863920"
msgid "Especially since I don't know what's going on.\nI need a grasp on the current situation as soon as possible."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "864028"
msgid "…understood. After you #C000246204go up to the 2nd floor,\nthe classroom on your left#CDEF\nwill be the #C000246204Student Council Room#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "864172"
msgid "As she says that, I look at the back of my left hand."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "864228"
msgid "There's one #C000246204Command Seal#CDEF left inscribed."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "864288"
msgid "#C000246204Command Seals#CDEF hold absolute directive authority over Servants;\nit's a special command that invokes all kinds of\ncoercive power upon a Servant in return for expending one."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "864476"
msgid "Simultaneously, they serve as proof that one is a Master.\nWhen a Master uses them all up…\n…uses them all up…\nWhat happens again?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "864608"
msgid "…whatever.\nWhat matters is that I have a proper contract with #C236196003#SVT#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "864696"
msgid "If I shut my eyes, I can clearly feel my vital source…\nMy magical energy flowing into #C236196003#SVT#CDEF.\n#C236196003#SVT#CDEF is alright, too."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "864844"
msgid "I want to meet with #C236196003#SVT#CDEF soon.\nI'll put off going to the Student Council Room and\nhead directly to #C000246204the classroom to my right on the 2nd floor#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "865020"
msgid "As she says that, I look at the back of my left hand."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "865076"
msgid "There was… no mark left at all.\nThe bruise was gone without a trace.\nI used them all \"just so I could speak with\" that\ngolden Servant."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "865212"
msgid "The #C000246204Command Seals#CDEF serve as proof that one is a Master.\nWhen a Master uses them all up…\n…uses them all up…\nWhat happens again?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "865360"
msgid "…it feels like I've gone down a path I can't turn back on."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "865420"
msgid "No use worrying about it.\nFirst, I should head to the #C0002462042nd floor classroom#CDEF\nand meet up with #C236196003Gilgamesh#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "865556"
msgid "How to uncover #C236196003Rani#CDEF's #C000246204SG#CDEF, hm……?\nWe don't seem to have any leads at the moment."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "865672"
msgid "The #C000246204Sakura Labyrinth#CDEF is the projection of a\nyoung girl's mind, which has become a Core.\nWe can only hope for a clue in the Labyrinth."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "865824"
msgid "#C236196003Rani#CDEF's secret… #C236196003Rani#CDEF's secret, huh…\nI feel as if the other two were like,\n\"Oh, yeah…\" but…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "865952"
msgid "That would be big trouble for us. If she herself\nhas a secret she doesn't know about, no amount\nof poking or prodding may do any good…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "866088"
msgid "Lady #C236196003Rani#CDEF's secret… Well, this is just my\nimpression, but she has an avid thirst for\nknowledge. A \"know-it-all,\" if you will."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "866232"
msgid "I interpreted her first #C000246204SG#CDEF to be, essentially,\nthe desire for a prince on a white stallion.\nThus… the third may be surprisingly childish."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "866388"
msgid "Though she appears to be one without pity,\nperhaps she merely has yet to learn a way\nto express her emotions?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "866500"
msgid "You want to know about my secrets…?\nUs AI have a duty to answer any question,\nso strictly speaking, I have none."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "866616"
msgid "However, there are some matters in which we've\nbeen preset to keep silent on. Private matters\n―those would count as secrets to us AI."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "866752"
msgid "If #C236196003Rani#CDEF is somewhat like us,\nthen I don't believe that she would ever\ntalk about her own secrets."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "866868"
msgid "I'm unable to define whether such instability\nis merely error, or something of the mind,\nthough…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "866968"
msgid "What is it, anyway? About #C236196003Rani#CDEF's secret?\nJust rile her up somehow\nand it'll all come tumbling out, duh."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "867088"
msgid "You're saying to challenge her to a competition?\nThat IS one idea. But, one thing…\nwhy is it that YOU know about our troubles?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "867216"
msgid "…a typical communication style for youth\nin the internet age… but #C236196003Shinji#CDEF:\nhow come you know what we're investigating?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "867352"
msgid "Amuse her with a gamble, and expose her\ntrue colors… Yes, the basics are there. But,\nwhy do YOU know of #C236196003#FAMILY#CDEF's troubles?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "867496"
msgid "B-by accident! I just happened to overhear\nwhen I was in front of the Student Council Room!\nI don't want to join you guys or anything!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "867632"
msgid "Hm? You say you want to know #C236196003Rani#CDEF's secret?\nYou… Again you're becoming more of an\naudacious #[manly man][Amazoness]#――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "867772"
msgid "…hmph. I do owe you for saving me, and\nthis could be a chance to flaunt my strength\nif I can do it, but forget it."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "867888"
msgid "I, #C236196003Monji Gatou#CDEF, am hopelessly clueless\nwhen it comes to the minds of women!\nEven Homer sometimes nods―― Gahahahaha!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "868024"
msgid "I know, since I've been monitoring.\n#C236196003Rani#CDEF's last secret, right?\nMmm…. Can't really say I'm sure."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "868140"
msgid "…let's see.\nThat young lady puts the conclusion\nfar too ahead of everything else."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "868224"
msgid "Discernment over intuition,\nchoice by necessity over chance.\nWhat happens when one lives as such, #C236196003Jinako#CDEF?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "868348"
msgid "Heck if I know.\nI'm pretty sure I told you not to redirect\nevery single topic over to #C236196003Jinako#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "868460"
msgid "…lose the experience of defeat, you mean.\nWhen those who possess great insight evade\ndefeat too much, they unfamiliarize it."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "868588"
msgid "Victory is assured when it involves one's\nexpertise. If the result turns out unlike what\nshe expects, you may see signs of her mind."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "868724"
msgid "…sorry, I said too much.\nAfter all, we merely observed over the monitor.\nI don't want you to take it to heart."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "868836"
msgid "\"A maiden's secret\"? Ha! No need to mull\nover it for even a second! You really thought\nI would want to know something like that!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "868968"
msgid "A young girl's troubles can always fall\ninto one of three groups: troubles over her\nface, over her chest, or over boys!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "869088"
msgid "There's no other topic as worthless to study!\nIf you want some fortune telling on love,\nask someone else. It's not my act to play in."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "869224"
msgid "…I apologize. As you can see,\ndiscussions about innocent boys and girls\nputs him in a worse mood than usual."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "869336"
msgid "But hey, #C236196003Andersen#CDEF?\nThere's no special reason why #C236196003Rani#CDEF would\nhave a secret about love, you know?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "869464"
msgid "Such is the mind of a maiden, casually\nleveraging her assets to entice her interest.\nGood lord, she's so proud her face is frozen!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "869596"
msgid "Hypothetically, if ever there was a writer who\nwould do that, then they should hurry and settle\ndown and switch to making documentaries."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "869736"
msgid "She's supposed to be in the Student Council\nroom backing me up. I wonder why she's here?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "869828"
msgid "…could it be that she's been waiting\nfor me… or something?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "869892"
msgid "…sorry. I had a question I really needed\nanswered, so I slipped out of the Student\nCouncil Room."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "869992"
msgid "No, I won't give up even under these\ncircumstances. You all don't understand."
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "870072"
msgid "I don't really know why."
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "870100"
msgid "For everyone's sake."
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "870124"
msgid "Because you looked like you were in pain."
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "870168"
msgid "For everyone's sake.#C246168255薗#CDEF"
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "870208"
msgid "Because you looked like you were in pain.#C246168255薗#CDEF"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "870268"
msgid "Is… that so.\nThough you don't know why, you believe.\nIt really is hard for an AI to grasp."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "870360"
msgid "#C236196003Sakura#CDEF gives a seemingly lonely laugh.\nCaught up in the moment, I also give a strained\nlaugh, and nod."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "870480"
msgid "I don't know the reason why,\nbut… I can't go running away.\nSince that belief is lit up within me."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "870580"
msgid "It wasn't that you fight even though you won't\nwin… You have to fight even if you don't\nwin, right?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "870684"
msgid "Great! Now it seems like I can understand\nSenpai better!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "870744"
msgid "I still haven't been able to analyze the cause,\nbut I want to try speaking with #C236196003#GIVEN#CDEF\nmore."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "870856"
msgid "The reason why I fight, which #C236196003Sakura#CDEF came to ask me for…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "870932"
msgid "While it is for the purpose of getting #C236196003Leo#CDEF, #C236196003Rin#CDEF,\nthe others, and myself out of here,\nit's also to assuage #C236196003Sakura#CDEF. Equally as much."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "871112"
msgid "#C236196003Sakura#CDEF lowers her shoulders, and, while\nshrinking away, looks up at me."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "871200"
msgid "I repeated the same answer.\nAs a result of restating myself, I became a bit shy."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "871284"
msgid "I will assist you!\nPlease, absolutely come back as the Senpai\nyou are now…!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "871364"
msgid "I notice that there's someone behind the curtain."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "871416"
msgid "…I wonder if #C236196003Sakura#CDEF is sleeping.\nSakura is an AI with several levels of\nprecision higher than NPCs.\nThe \"sleep\" function she possesses\nisn't simulated; it's real… I think."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "871608"
msgid "As I make my way towards the bed,\nI try to be quiet about it,\nbut end up making audible footsteps anyways."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "871716"
msgid "I saw the figure of a lone girl,\nquietly breathing in and out."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "871780"
msgid "On her skin was a thin coat of perspiration."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "871828"
msgid "Her temperature was as if she was melting in a sealed room."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "871888"
msgid "Her chest undulated in rhythm with the beating of her heart."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "871952"
msgid "#C080080080While understanding that I had no memory of such,#CDEF"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "872020"
msgid "#C080080080I recalled a fragmented dream.#CDEF"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "872068"
msgid "…I come to my senses, then back away from the bed."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "872120"
msgid "If she's deep asleep, then there's\nno need to wake her up for nothing."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "872192"
msgid "Ah, you came for some medicine, right?\nSorry, I dozed off. I'll get some for\nyou right away, so please wait a moment."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "872312"
msgid "Though I had no reason to feel guilty,\nI became embarrassed.\nMaybe because the sight of #C236196003Sakura#CDEF\nsleeping was vivid in my mind."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "872456"
msgid "…I remember it one more time."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "872488"
msgid "Sorry for the wait.\nHere, please take this medicine.\nPlease do your best during your search, okay?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "872588"
msgid "Even in times like these… no, because of times\nlike these, I'm glad that I can rely on you."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "872684"
msgid "Yes, I've recovered now. It seems that scanning\nthe inside of the Labyrinth takes quite\na toll on me…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "872788"
msgid "It appears that I caught a case of those\nrevelatory fevers humans speak of,\nbut I'm all better now!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "872888"
msgid "I also performed a system check, but I\ndidn't detect anything out of the ordinary."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "872972"
msgid "My system harmonizes well with this Infirmary,\nso I recover quickly. Ah… is it weird for me\nto sleep, even though I'm an AI?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "873100"
msgid "I immediately reply, \"Not at all.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "873136"
msgid "It's good that you're human-like, actually.\nI expressed my feelings honestly,\nabout how I wanted #C236196003Sakura#CDEF to stay the way she is now."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "873284"
msgid "……………\nWh-wh-what? No way, I still have a fever…?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "873340"
msgid "…I'm sorry.\nIt looks like I'm still unstable."
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "873388"
msgid "It's not good to push yourself."
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "873420"
msgid "You should check up one more time."
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "873456"
msgid "You should still be resting."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "873488"
msgid "No, I really am all better now! Um, though my\ntemperature is rising, I'm sort of like,\nbrimming with energy―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "873604"
msgid "Well, nevermind. It's not something\nthat even I understand, so I attribute it\nto the Infirmary's capabilities."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "873716"
msgid "Now then, I need to make good use of all the\nrest I got. I'm going back to the command room,\nokay?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "873816"
msgid "Thank you very much, #C236196003#GIVEN#CDEF.\nI have somewhat of a special hunch that\nthis was a great experience!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "873932"
msgid "#C236196003Sakura#CDEF smiles cheerfully at this trivial thing,\nthen disappears from sight."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "874024"
msgid "…I didn't get to say that I came to visit her,\nbut as long as she took it well, then I can say\nthat it was worth dropping by."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "874152"
msgid "Leaving #C236196003#SVT#CDEF in the hallway,\nI enter the Infirmary alone."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "874228"
msgid "#C236196003Sakura#CDEF is―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "874260"
msgid "I start by explaining the situation.\n\"I heard you fainted, so I came to check up on you.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "874352"
msgid "I was resting up until just now, so my bodily\nfunctions have almost recovered. But…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "874440"
msgid "You're more exhausted than I am, #C236196003#GIVEN#CDEF.\nI can tell without a scan.\nYou look pale, overall not good."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "874560"
msgid "I think you pushed yourself a little too\nhard, #C236196003#GIVEN#CDEF.\nPlease consider your own needs, okay?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "874672"
msgid "\"*tsk tsk*\" goes #C236196003Sakura#CDEF, as if scolding a child."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "874740"
msgid "…that's odd. Her little gesture makes me feel\nawfully relieved."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "874808"
msgid "I declined, telling her it's not necessary."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "874852"
msgid "………umm.\nIf you have the time, maybe you can\nstay here for just a while longer?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "874936"
msgid "\"AI don't do pointless things\"…\nMaybe it's weird if you take that\nnature of theirs into account?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "875036"
msgid "Regardless, staying in the Infirmary works just fine for me.\nI nod and take a seat, \"of course.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "875136"
msgid "All we've had you do is fight, fight, fight.\nAt least let me treat you to some tea\nwhenever you're in the Infirmary."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "875256"
msgid "I almost made the blunder of my life\nthanks to her tricky linguistics."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "875328"
msgid "Yes, please help yourself.\nI tried reproducing high grade Keemun tea―\nYou can't find this on Earth anymore."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "875440"
msgid "The black tea #C236196003Sakura#CDEF made for me has a flowery fragrance."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "875516"
msgid "\n\nWe're not doing anything.\nWe don't need to talk about anything.\nWe're just leisurely enjoying some tea."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "875624"
msgid "There's a clock ticking.\nThe setting sun dyes the interior orange."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "875692"
msgid "The countless worries always hovering over\nme are no longer present."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "875764"
msgid "Next thing I knew, I was expressing doubts\nthat were weighing on my mind."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "875840"
msgid "About how despite having my memories back,\n#C000246204I can't recall the reason why I fight#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "875940"
msgid "About the fear of if I'm nothing more than\na nameless \"somebody,\" even as of now―\neven if I did participate and fight through the #C000246204Holy Grail War#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "876104"
msgid "I probably chose to fight through the #C000246204Holy Grail War#CDEF\nto shed light on my#RUBS   circumstances#RUBE own reasons#REND, to find out who I was."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "876260"
msgid "Against that person―me―Masters fought and perished."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "876316"
msgid "Some fought for desire, some fought for beliefs,\nsome fought for faith, some fought for ideals―"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "876416"
msgid "And finally, some fought to prove themselves―\nThey all gambled their lives, and lost."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "876504"
msgid "The person who won―stole―their way to the top\nhas all the more obligation to stay strong."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "876596"
msgid "…and yet.\nI understand that, and yet still feel restless."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "876656"
msgid "Is my worth really based solely\non compensating for their deaths?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "876724"
msgid "Before I lost my memories, was I―――\nIs the #C236196003#FAMILY #GIVEN#CDEF sitting here now\na person worthy of being a Master?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "876856"
msgid "…umm. I don't know how quite to put this,\nbut is it really that important if you\nhave memories or not?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "876960"
msgid "I'm an AI. Both my body and my personality\nwere originally created to \"be a certain way.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "877052"
msgid "And that doesn't involve any past experiences.\nI run myself as me, and even if I AM artificial,\nI live in the present."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "877172"
msgid "In the same way, you, Senpai… you, #C236196003#GIVEN#CDEF,\nare living in the present. Even without\nyour past, your soul remains the same."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "877312"
msgid "Regardless of whether you have a past or not,\nyour abilities are hardwired;\nthe performance you exhibit is hardwired."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "877432"
msgid "Ah, well… I know that experience in doing\nsomething raises one's abilities.\nS-so, let's leave the details aside…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "877548"
msgid "What I'm basically trying to say is that\nyou're fantastic even without a past, Senpai…\nNo matter your situation, um,"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "877668"
msgid "―――There must be someone that owes you for\nyour help.\nI get that sort of feeling."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "877756"
msgid "#C236196003Sakura#CDEF does her utmost best in explaining,\nso as to encourage my disheartened self."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "877856"
msgid "Though this doesn't actually solve anything,\njust hearing her say that\n\"not having a past is fine\" was a warm light\nupon my sorry self."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "877992"
msgid "I-I'm sorry for speaking out of line.\nHearing these words from an AI\nisn't very convincing, is it…"
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "878092"
msgid "It sure is out of line."
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "878116"
msgid "Are you feeling alright?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "878144"
msgid "I-I'm sorry…\nBut I really wanted to express my\nthoughts with you, Senpai…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "878220"
msgid "T-thank you very much!\nI'm glad… I knew I might get scolded, but I\nwanted to express my thoughts to you, Senpai."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "878336"
msgid "Y-yes, I feel fine!\nI was just a little tired, but I'm more\nchipper than ever, as you can see!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "878432"
msgid "I'm happy that you're concerned for me. I was\nafraid you might not like me for it, but I'm\nglad I was able to express myself to you."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "878568"
msgid "Like, special. Even if there's no reason,\nI don't want to leave you alone."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "878644"
msgid "Your wish is to escape from this place, Senpai.\nAs an AI, helping you is logically to be\nexpected…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "878744"
msgid "I'm not sure why, but in spite of that,\nit feels like you and I are similar.\nIt makes me want to root for you."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "878856"
msgid "#C236196003Sakura#CDEF laughs jokingly,\n\"I'm not a very good AI, am I?\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "878928"
msgid "Next thing I knew, all the uneasiness\nlurking inside of me dissipated."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "879000"
msgid "I guess it's thanks to #C236196003Sakura#CDEF,\nand the black tea she made for me."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "879084"
msgid "No, I had nothing to do with it.\nDid you know? This is magic tea,\nit helps all your emotions settle out."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "879192"
msgid "I've seen that gesture before―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "879228"
msgid "―――That's right."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "879248"
msgid "This is the setting that I've seen countless\ntimes in that dream, previously."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "879328"
msgid "I don't think it was a dream.\nI have a feeling that I've spent countless,\npeaceful moments with #C236196003Sakura#CDEF here…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "879456"
msgid "I nod,\n\"That's the feeling I'm getting.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "879500"
msgid "After #C236196003Sakura#CDEF mulls over it for a while:"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "879556"
msgid "AI, unlike quasi-Spiritronized humans,\ndon't consciously/unconsciously forget things.\nSo there's no mistake."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "879668"
msgid "No, there's no reason why an AI would lie."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "879712"
msgid "…well, it's about that time.\nIf I hold you here for too long,\n#C236196003Leo#CDEF will start yelling at me."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "879824"
msgid "Be careful exploring the Labyrinth.\nKeep up the good work, Senpai."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "879892"
msgid "#C236196003Sakura#CDEF sees me out of the Infirmary."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "879948"
msgid "Alright―――Let's get our heads back\nin the game and continue the exploration."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "880028"
msgid "The sound of the door must've woken her up."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "880072"
msgid "#C236196003Sakura#CDEF, who was sleeping in bed,\nquickly got up to greet her visitor."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "880160"
msgid "…#C236196003Sakura#CDEF's hair is changing."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "880208"
msgid "The signs were there before, but it's gotten worse.\nThere's no doubt about it now."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "880292"
msgid "Maintaining the Old School's systems alone is a big task,\nbut providing #ROFS-024#RUBSmental preservation#RUBEbackup#REND during Labyrinth explorations\non top of that puts a huge strain on her."
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "880488"
msgid "…how are you holding up?"
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "880516"
msgid "I want you to be resting in bed."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "880552"
msgid "Having some rest helped me recover. I made some\noptimizations by clearing out my extraneous\nparts. I'll be back to work in no time."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "880684"
msgid "The Infirmary doubles as my tuning room.\nSimply being in here provides self-healing\nand self-diagnoses."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "880788"
msgid "Anyway, I'll go put on some tea. You went out\nof your way to come visit, so I\nshould do somet―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "880888"
msgid "…I feel #C236196003Sakura#CDEF's body in my arms.\nShe's unusually cold."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "880964"
msgid "Her warmth―――from before―――\nAs if she were a living being―\nHardly half of it is left."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "881060"
msgid "Maybe just like the #C000246204Moon Cell#CDEF,\nshe's already been eroded down―――"
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "881144"
msgid "…is it happening to your body as well?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "881184"
msgid "#C236196003Sakura#CDEF hesitates, but I repeat my question again."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "881252"
msgid "By principle, AI can't lie.\nThat compelling force isn't as strong as a #C000246204Command Seal#CDEF though."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "881360"
msgid "If she has a duty to keep a topic confidential,\nthen it might be fruitless to ask,\nbut I would expect that she HAS to give SOME response\nto a Master's question."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "881524"
msgid "…yes, it's heavy-handed.\nBut this is about her health after all."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "881592"
msgid "If #C236196003Sakura#CDEF is going to take on this burden,\nthen the bare minimum she can do is make\nsure I know what's going on."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "881724"
msgid "……I understand. #C236196003Rin#CDEF and #C236196003Rani#CDEF are probably\naware. Leaving you out of the picture isn't\nreally what I want, Senpai."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "881872"
msgid "Just as the #C000246204Moon Cell#CDEF is eroding away,\nthe data defining my configuration\nis beginning to degrade."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "881988"
msgid "It's now a challenge for me to even manage\neach Master's health. I can still make lunch\nand stuff like that, though."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "882108"
msgid "Updates… So basically, they're forcibly keeping\nher functioning through additional patches on her,\nbreaking down from the degradation as she is."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "882256"
msgid "Humans call this \"taking drastic measures.\"\nThey're just slapping big bandages over the\nholes popping up all over her. That's all it is."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "882396"
msgid "It does nothing to treat her wounds,\nlet alone solve the root of the problem―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "882480"
msgid "It's fine. I've been broken from the very\nbeginning. Without their efforts, I would be\nfading away even faster than this."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "882604"
msgid "So… Please, don't worry about it.\nYou look so sad because of me, Senpai,\nand it hurts."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "882692"
msgid "―――I need to think of something.\nSomething I can do for her right now:"
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "882768"
msgid "Transfer Sakurament to her."
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "882796"
msgid "……I don't have enough to spare."
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "882832"
msgid "Transfer Sakurament to her.#C246168255薗#CDEF"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "882880"
msgid "This only applies to the #C000246204Far Side of the Moon#CDEF,\nbut Sakurament serves as a power source within the #C000246204Moon Cell#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "883024"
msgid "It's an imaginary element in this cyberspace:\n#RUBS         mana#RUBEmagical energy#REND, unevenly distributed throughout this domain."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "883160"
msgid "It doesn't have some almighty power that can\ndo anything, but shouldn't it be able to at least\nkeep #C236196003Sakura#CDEF from falling apart…!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "883308"
msgid "N-no way, you mustn't!\nSakurament is a valuable resource,\nplease use it to help yourself, Senpai!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "883408"
msgid "That's exactly what I'll do.\nI'll help myself―by using it on #C236196003Sakura#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "883496"
msgid "…I don't know the reason why, myself."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "883536"
msgid "It's just that―I don't want #C236196003Sakura#CDEF to suffer.\nI want her to keep smiling,\n                                         like she used to before,\nright here and now."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "883716"
msgid "Transferring Sakurament to her was easy."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "883760"
msgid "Sakurament has always been manipulated by\nthe administrative side of the #C000246204Moon Cell#CDEF\nto keep balance here in cyberspace."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "883896"
msgid "#C236196003Sakura#CDEF smiles, and I smile back.\nI grab her hand to check how she's faring―\nHer body temperature is normal again."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "884028"
msgid "Is there another problem?\nI ask her if something is bothering her."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "884096"
msgid "Oh… no, umm.\nI just kind of don't understand."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "884144"
msgid "She doesn't understand?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "884168"
msgid "…yes. I noticed before that something was\nweird, didn't I? But I don't know what the\ncause is."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "884264"
msgid "I'm an AI created to manage everyone's health.\nIt's only natural that I take care of you,\nSenpai."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "884364"
msgid "…it's natural, but still. Ever since coming\nto the #C000246204Far Side of the Moon#CDEF, I've felt strange.\n…like my priorities aren't straight…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "884512"
msgid "Inside, I'm configured to prioritize anything\nrelated to you over everyone's health, Senpai.\n…I mustn't do that, right?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "884636"
msgid "Inside, I'm configured to prioritize saving you\nover everyone's health, Senpai.\n\"I mustn't let this person die.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "884752"
msgid "\"This person is my irreplaceable and very\nfirst friend\"――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "884812"
msgid "I feel genuinely happy about being considered special to her.\n…as well as a little embarrassed."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "884912"
msgid "But I think it's a matter of efficiency.\nAt the moment, the best resource we have for\nnormalizing the #C000246204Moon Cell#CDEF is you, Senpai."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "885056"
msgid "As an AI, it only makes sense for me\nto make you the highest priority, right, Senpai?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "885144"
msgid "…I see.\nSince #C236196003#FAMILY #GIVEN#CDEF is a human that could save\nthe #C000246204Moon Cell#CDEF, #C236196003Sakura#CDEF gives #C236196003#FAMILY #GIVEN#CDEF\npriority."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "885320"
msgid "These AI are something else.\nIt's as calculating and self-serving a bias as it gets…\nOne could call it as such, but…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "885440"
msgid "Yes, it's only natural. There's nothing strange\nabout me… It's logical to prioritize Senpai."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "885536"
msgid "So why then… does something so obvious\nmake me so happy? I don't understand.\nAt this rate, I'll also―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "885644"
msgid "?\n#C236196003Sakura#CDEF looks down and murmurs something to herself."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "885716"
msgid "So anyway, I'll go put on some tea now that\nI'm feeling better! Got to have some tea,\nno two ways about it!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "885824"
msgid "#C236196003Sakura#CDEF begins preparing some tea."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "885876"
msgid "…thank goodness.\nIn any case, #C236196003Sakura#CDEF is in better spirits again.\nLooks like I can return to exploring the Labyrinth\nwithout anything holding me back―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "886048"
msgid "Maybe #C236196003Sakura#CDEF will feel better if I administer\nSakurament―which is essentially #RUBS        mana  #RUBEmagical energy#REND―to her."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "886196"
msgid "I make up my mind to do so and\ncheck how much Sakurament I have."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "886264"
msgid "…but I don't have enough on hand to reduce the load on #C236196003Sakura#CDEF.\nDespite being the one to suggest it, I really dropped the ball."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "886408"
msgid "…but I don't have much to spare.\n#C236196003Sakura#CDEF will have to keep putting up with it for us."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "886512"
msgid "No, that's the right thing to do, Senpai.\nEven if I was given Sakurament,\nthe pain would only be briefly alleviated."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "886632"
msgid "…#C236196003Sakura#CDEF smiles, then walks to the back of the Infirmary.\nHer steps are still a little wobbly,\nbut it doesn't look like she's pushing herself too hard."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "886800"
msgid "…she's fighting her own battle.\nAnd I'll give undivided attention to mine―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "886884"
msgid "I have #C236196003#SVT#CDEF wait in the hallway for me\nand enter the Infirmary."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "886964"
msgid "I hear a frail voice come from the bed.\nI tell her who I am and then ask if I can go over to her."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "887064"
msgid "O-of course!\nI'll get some tea ready right n―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "887116"
msgid "Ah, but please give me one moment!\nI'm checking a few things!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "887180"
msgid "I hear… it's not quite thudding and banging,\nbut from the other side of the curtains\nI hear the sounds of rushing around.\nThey're more like snapping and clicking sounds, maybe."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "887360"
msgid "S-sorry to make you wait!\nNow I should be perfectly fine!\nI can chat, no problem!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "887444"
msgid "Thank you for visiting me, Senpai. As you can\nsee, I'm feeling much better, so I'll be heading\nback to the Student Council Room soon."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "887580"
msgid "The way she smiles makes me want to smile back."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "887628"
msgid "…but I can't honestly be happy right now."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "887672"
msgid "Her hair is changing even more in color,\nand I don't know if she can't regulate her body\ntemperature or what, because I hold her hand and\nit's cold like porcelain. That warmth she initially had,\nas if she were a living, breathing being, is no longer there."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "887932"
msgid "Only a little Labyrinth left to go.\nWe need to clear it as soon as possible,\ndefeat #C236196003Meltlilith#CDEF―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "888052"
msgid "Reach the Core before #C236196003BB#CDEF does,\nand send you back to the Near Side, Senpai."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "888144"
msgid "As if to disguise her poor health,\n#C236196003Sakura#CDEF continues talking with a smile on her face.\nI will―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "888260"
msgid "#C236196003Sakura#CDEF is hiding her pain and making it look like she's fine.\nI can't bring myself to waste her concern for me."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "888388"
msgid "We spend some time together\ncontinuing to talk about nothing in particular."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "888464"
msgid "…I was talking to #C236196003Rin#CDEF and #C236196003Rani#CDEF about this just now."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "888552"
msgid "I ask #C236196003Sakura#CDEF about the reason why she's so dedicated."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "888624"
msgid "Does #C236196003Sakura#CDEF have emotions?\nLike those two were saying, does she like #C236196003#FAMILY\n#GIVEN#CDEF?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "888744"
msgid "I've said it before. Of course I do.\n#C236196003#FAMILY #GIVEN#CDEF is a highly effective\nMaster who's going to fix the #C000246204Moon Cell#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "888892"
msgid "That's not what I mean.\nWell, this would be simple if it was, but it's not."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "888968"
msgid "I tell her to forget the #C000246204Moon Cell#CDEF and\nsuppose I wasn't a Master.\nIn \"a human way,\" how does she\nfeel about \"#C236196003#FAMILY #GIVEN#CDEF\"?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "889128"
msgid "I care for you because you should be\nprioritized. Yet, I want to prioritize you\nbecause I care for you. It's as if I'm―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "889256"
msgid "However.\nTo me, she was human-like from the beginning."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "889312"
msgid "There must've been a day where I thought,\n\"I want to protect her.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "889380"
msgid "A day where I was here in this Infirmary.\nWhile we were chatting together, like we are today."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "889476"
msgid "I can quantify likes and dislikes. Good will and\nill will are rational things. However―――\nLove is the one thing I cannot reproduce."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "889612"
msgid "Love is a contradiction unique to humans,\nand it's inherently unnecessary."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "889688"
msgid "The #C000246204Moon Cell#CDEF will not recognize phenomenons\nwhich cannot be proven experimentally.\n…science denies love."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "889812"
msgid "…that's the reason.\nYou're mistaken to think I can\n\"simply\" like a human."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "889888"
msgid "There's no way I can come to \"like\" you,\nSenpai――I'm utterly incapable of doing so."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "889976"
msgid "Those words leave a heavy impression on me.\nThat's the #C000246204Moon Cell#CDEF's current conclusion on the matter."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "890096"
msgid "When a human pursues another human,\nthey merely act in the pursuit of reproduction.\nPleasure and joy are merely factors that accelerate\nreproduction."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "890248"
msgid "No―――\n#RUBSSomething#RUBELove,#REND which alters the criteria for one's\nsurvival over dubious reasons, isn't even necessary."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "890376"
msgid "B-but, please don't worry about it. I'll be\nbiased towards Senpai until the very end! Even\nthough I don't know the reason why!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "890504"
msgid "Personally, I want her to state the reason clearly.\nI'm not sure I like her choice of the word \"bias.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "890608"
msgid "Having relaxed while we were talking, #C236196003Sakura#CDEF stands up.\nShe insists that because she got enough rest,\nshe'll be returning to the Student Council Room."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "890776"
msgid "As much as I'd like to keep her resting,\nwe don't have the time. All I can do is―――"
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "890864"
msgid "Trust Sakura to handle things."
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "890896"
msgid "Transfer Sakurament to her."
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "890924"
msgid "Transfer Sakurament to her.#C246168255薗#CDEF"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "890972"
msgid "All I can do is trust #C236196003Sakura#CDEF to handle things.\nIt's not possible for us to resolve\nthis situation without her help."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "891104"
msgid "I'll administer Sakurament to her again…\nOr so I would like to do, but unfortunately\nI don't have enough on me."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "891220"
msgid "It feels a bit pathetic, but all I can do at this point\nis trust #C236196003Sakura#CDEF to handle things."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "891328"
msgid "I go to leave the Infirmary ahead of her."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "891372"
msgid "We ended up talking for a lot longer than I thought we would.\n#C236196003#SVT#CDEF must be tired of waiting."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "891484"
msgid "…I think about it calmly and end up surprising even myself."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "891548"
msgid "I really have no hatred for #C236196003BB#CDEF.\nI understand that she's the root of all evil,\nbut I can't bring myself to detest her."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "891684"
msgid "…no need to think that one over again.\n#C236196003BB#CDEF is the root of all evil.\nI have no reason to like her."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "891800"
msgid "I feel like I don't hate her,\nand I also don't like her."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "891860"
msgid "#C236196003BB#CDEF may be a rogue AI threatening humanity,\nbut I don't get the sense that she's evil.\nIt feels like she just has different values than we do."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "892020"
msgid "Senpai, you're fighting to protect humanity…\nNo, to protect #C236196003Rin#CDEF, #C236196003Rani#CDEF,\nand the #C000246204Moon Cell#CDEF, right?"
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "892168"
msgid "And for you, Sakura."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "892192"
msgid "I knew it!\nI'll be rooting for you. Please make sure you\ntake #C236196003BB#CDEF down!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "892280"
msgid "Huh? Despite the situation, you have\nanother reason…? I-I'm a little moved. You\nhave so much depth to you, Senpai! I knew it!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "892408"
msgid "I repeat that I still want to protect her anyway."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "892460"
msgid "I want to go back to where we're supposed to be―with you."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "892520"
msgid "…okay. You're right.\nIf you can pull it off, you'll have\nnothing to regret."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "892600"
msgid "Such an ending―――\nEven within the #C000246204Moon Cell#CDEF, it would\nbe extraordinary, I think."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "892700"
msgid "I leave the Infirmary.\nI'm still worried about #C236196003Sakura#CDEF's health,\nbut let's switch gears."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "892804"
msgid "There's not much time left.\nWe need to defeat #C236196003Meltlilith#CDEF and rush to the Core!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "892900"
msgid "…I ready myself and open the door.\n#C236196003Sakura#CDEF is standing by the table."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "892988"
msgid "She smiles somberly, as if having reached the\nend of a dream―or as if having realized the dream was over."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "893096"
msgid "…so it WAS hers."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "893116"
msgid "#C236196003BB#CDEF wanted to \"keep them away\" for as long as possible.\nIt wouldn't hurt her if they were stolen,\nbut for some sentimental reason,\nshe \"didn't want to return\" them."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "893296"
msgid "Those memories were of #C236196003Sakura#CDEF's time in the Infirmary."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "893368"
msgid "…I remember now.\nAll the things that happened here.\nWhat the truth #C236196003BB#CDEF was hiding was about."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "893480"
msgid "#C236196003Sakura#CDEF began to speak without any deceit;\nin a way that presents herself as an AI."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "893580"
msgid "Devoid of human-like emotion or hesitation with\nhard-to-discuss facts; in a detached manner,\nshe speaks only the truth."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "893700"
msgid "As you said, Senpai, I spent many days\nwith you right here in the Infirmary.\nWe drank tea, and talked about your classes."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "893824"
msgid "Our passing of the time was unremarkable;\nwe were as real, normal students."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "893900"
msgid "However, I had only met her for one, single day.\nAlso, the #C000246204Holy Grail War#CDEF preliminaries are set to last\njust four days."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "894036"
msgid "No matter how I look at it, there's an inconsistency\nregarding the number of days I spent in that Infirmary.\nWhat can explain that…?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "894172"
msgid "I was out of line. #C236196003Sakura#CDEF… I, back then,\nrepeatedly looped the first day and spent\nthe time with you, Senpai."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "894300"
msgid "An abnormal bug had occurred within me back\nthen, causing me to stray from my management of\nthe #C000246204Moon Cell#CDEF. You were the one who saved me."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "894456"
msgid "Yet the truth is, I meddled with the #C000246204Moon Cell#CDEF\nand repeated the first day of the preliminaries\nfor just us as many times as I could. But…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "894612"
msgid "I… #C236196003Sakura Matou#CDEF didn't have the power to keep\nit up forever. Upon reaching my limit on the\n69th day, time rightfully returned to you――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "894768"
msgid "The preliminaries had ended, and it seems that\nyou had advanced to the final selection. I think\nyou know the events after that better than I."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "894912"
msgid "Although, I no longer have any recollection\nof what happened during all those reboots."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "895000"
msgid "Erased…?\nThose memories…?\nWhy would she do such a thing?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "895060"
msgid "…Senpai, do you know how the #C000246204Holy Grail War#CDEF\nrules apply to those who serve the #C000246204Moon Cell#CDEF?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "895184"
msgid "NPCs and advanced AI were built by the\n#C000246204Moon Cell#CDEF as support units for the Masters."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "895284"
msgid "As soon as the #C000246204Holy Grail War#CDEF concluded,\nthey would be disassembled and reverted back\ninto mere memory."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "895404"
msgid "Do you understand? We of the #C000246204Moon Cell#CDEF…\nor rather, we #RUBS recyclable#RUBEnon-human#REND virtual lifeforms\nget deleted when the #C000246204Holy Grail War#CDEF ends."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "895588"
msgid "…I've heard that somewhere before.\nMaybe I have a memory of it from back in\nthe Near Side of the Moon's proper #C000246204Holy Grail War#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "895732"
msgid "The #C000246204Moon Cell#CDEF doesn't allow for the existence of AI.\nAll the supercomputers on Earth put together would\npale in comparison to the divine brain:\nthe #C000246204Moon Cell Automaton#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "895936"
msgid "And yet, this computing machine adamantly\ndenies it contains artificial intelligence."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "896024"
msgid "Yes. The #C000246204Moon Cell#CDEF does not tolerate AI who\ndevelop beyond expectation… It doesn't tolerate\nbugs that will disrupt the #C000246204Holy Grail War#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "896192"
msgid "#C236196003Sakura#CDEF went \"out of line\" and repeated\nthe time we spent together."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "896276"
msgid "If the #C000246204Moon Cell#CDEF discovers this,\nforget about her experience;\nher entire framework will get deleted."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "896396"
msgid "That's why―――She had no choice but to personally\ndelete the evidence of her being out of line,\nthe memories of those 69 days."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "896528"
msgid "Yes. If I were to be deleted,\nI would be succeeded by an AI named #C236196003Caren#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "896620"
msgid "…the thing about her is, um, her algorithms\nhave some \"issues\" where she doesn't prioritize\nthe Masters' lives."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "896736"
msgid "She values tribulation over life. If she were to\nbe managing the Masters' health, the chance of\nyour survival, Senpai, would be…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "896868"
msgid "Extremely low.\nIn fact, apparently no more than 3% by the 3rd Round."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "896940"
msgid "…what I'm about to say is just conjecture,\nbut I think that #C236196003BB#CDEF is the one that caused\nme to go out of line."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "897068"
msgid "She's my backup.\nHowever, she must've woken up while I\nwas acting out of line."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "897148"
msgid "Her baseline in managing human\nhealth… has gone haywire."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "897208"
msgid "She's been insane since awaking; a management AI\nusing her privileges to grow so powerful in\nthe #C000246204Far Side of the Moon#CDEF, then dominating it."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "897364"
msgid "She's a disease harming the #C000246204Moon Cell#CDEF:\na #C000246204Moon Cancer#CDEF.\nStill, it was I who generated her."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "897488"
msgid "…it's not that #C236196003BB#CDEF and I are the same model;\nwe're one and the same AI."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "897576"
msgid "She may be a different AI at this point,\nbut she was originally the same: #C236196003Sakura#CDEF.\nThis is the \"truth\" #C236196003BB#CDEF was hiding."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "897728"
msgid "So #C236196003Sakura#CDEF says, and then stops talking.\nShe probably doesn't want to look me in the eyes,\nbut she bravely does so anyway."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "897868"
msgid "#C236196003Sakura#CDEF confesses that she's the one responsible.\nI―――"
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "897944"
msgid "Don't forgive her."
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "897964"
msgid "Forgive her."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "897980"
msgid "Whatever her reasons may be, many Masters\nwere sacrificed as a result.\nI can't forgive #C236196003Sakura#CDEF for acting out of line."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "898116"
msgid "Still… denouncing her at this point won't solve our problems."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "898180"
msgid "All I should be doing is focusing on stopping #C236196003BB#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "898248"
msgid "#C236196003Sakura#CDEF is fully aware of this, which is\nwhy she's risking her life by working with us."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "898352"
msgid "…to me, I don't consider what she did to be sinful\nor all that wrong."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "898424"
msgid "Who was most in the wrong here?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "898456"
msgid "I would say that the #C000246204Moon Cell#CDEF is at fault for not\nhelping #C236196003Sakura#CDEF when she was suffering."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "898580"
msgid "Besides, #C236196003Sakura#CDEF has been helpful to #C236196003Rin#CDEF, #C236196003Rani#CDEF, and me."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "898684"
msgid "She would've been better off if she had abandoned the humans.\nYet, she's risking her life to help us.\nHow can anyone denounce her, knowing that?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "898832"
msgid "There's something I heard once somewhere:\nadvanced AI can't tell lies to a Master's detriment\nand can't forge or modify administrative records."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "898976"
msgid "Therefore, everything she said was the truth."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "899024"
msgid "She's making it abundantly clear as to where the blame lies.\nIf there were anything left unclear, it wouldn't be\n\"how she did it,\" but the motive behind \"why she did it.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "899196"
msgid "AIs are created to serve everyone. They're\nexpendable and inevitably break. There's no\nneed for you to be concerned over me."
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "899324"
msgid "…if that makes Sakura feel better…"
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "899364"
msgid "…I'm not fine with that."
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "899392"
msgid "…I'm not fine with that.#C246168255薗#CDEF"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "899436"
msgid "#C236196003Sakura#CDEF spoke with indifference."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "899484"
msgid "I can't treat #C236196003Sakura#CDEF like she's expendable,\nbut I'm struggling to verbalize how to say it."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "899592"
msgid "Realizing that she was the cause of all this,\nshe did all in her power to at least help\nthe humans who remained."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "899708"
msgid "I can't bring myself to undermine her\ndetermination by consoling her in this particular moment."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "899804"
msgid "No matter what happens, I will protect everyone.\nIn that, at least―――please, believe me."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "899896"
msgid "I nod back at #C236196003Sakura#CDEF and leave the Infirmary."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "899960"
msgid "Defeating #C236196003BB#CDEF and restoring the #C000246204Moon Cell#CDEF back to normal\nis the only solution I have that will make her feel better."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "900108"
msgid "I should fight for just my own sake…?\nI don't have to care about #C236196003Sakura#CDEF?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "900200"
msgid "I've long since forgotten how to do such things."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "900252"
msgid "―――After all, I remember this warmth she has."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "900304"
msgid "Once, she had collapsed near the entrance in pain.\n     Tears welled up in her eyes from me simply calling\n     out to her―I remember her warmth."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "900452"
msgid "I did what was proper for an AI to do.\nI have no need for love. I erased all my records\nand returned to being a proper AI."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "900576"
msgid "…all I can do for #C236196003Sakura#CDEF right now,\nsilently crying as she is, is to #[hold her][cheer her up]#."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "900692"
msgid "I can only recall the days\nwe spent in this Infirmary together in fragments."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "900772"
msgid "So, it was all one big loop from her overwriting things?\nI do sense that I spent a lot of time here,\nbut I'm uncertain as to what had occurred."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "900916"
msgid "That's why―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "900936"
msgid "\"I don't want you to ever say those things again.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "900988"
msgid "I tell that to #C236196003Sakura#CDEF, then let go of her hand."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "901052"
msgid "Once again, I… I promise not as a nurse,\nbut as myself this time: I will return you\nall to your world without fail."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "901172"
msgid "So please don't you go giving up either, Senpai.\nNo matter what happens, I'm on your side."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "901264"
msgid "#C236196003Sakura#CDEF's smile and words are trustier\nthan a million troops."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "901344"
msgid "This is where we make our comeback.\nI tell her that I'm heading out, then leave the Infirmary."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "901440"
msgid "Who am I?\nWhat did I desire from the #C000246204Holy Grail War#CDEF?\nThe answers to those questions won't come to me.\nHowever, now I have a firm grasp on what I need to do."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "901616"
msgid "―――I'm going to protect her."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "901648"
msgid "…#C236196003#GIVEN#CDEF.\nAh, looking to rest for a while?\nI'll go ready some tea."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "901732"
msgid "…Senpai.\nAh, looking to rest for a while?\nI'll go ready some tea."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "901800"
msgid "Like I thought, #C236196003Sakura#CDEF was in the Infirmary."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "901864"
msgid "I guess #C236196003Sakura#CDEF moved over here in order\nto get out of #C236196003Rin#CDEF and #C236196003Rani#CDEF's way,\nbeing disheartened as they are and all."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "902028"
msgid "I drink the tea #C236196003Sakura#CDEF prepared for me."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "902084"
msgid "And this one's got this superb warmth and bitterness to it."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "902144"
msgid "Just one sip is enough to dispel the haze over my mind.\nYep. #C236196003Sakura#CDEF is definitely an expert at making tea."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "902268"
msgid "#C236196003#GIVEN#CDEF? Why are you laughing\nall of a sudden? What is it?\nD-did I make a bad blend, maybe!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "902376"
msgid "I drink the tea #C236196003Sakura#CDEF prepared for me."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "902432"
msgid "Even in our present situation,\nI can taste the superb warmth and bitterness of this tea."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "902524"
msgid "Just one sip is enough to dispel the haze over my mind.\n…I'm in wonder. #C236196003Sakura#CDEF may just be an expert at making tea."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "902660"
msgid "S-Senpai? Why are you laughing all of a sudden?\nWhat is it? D-did I make a bad blend, maybe!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "902756"
msgid "Not at all.\nI answer with a strained laugh,\n\"Your tea is exquisite, #C236196003Sakura#CDEF.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "902852"
msgid "I-I'm glad to hear that… This is all I have\nleft. If I fail at making tea, then that leaves\nme with no reason to exist…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "902976"
msgid "\"All she has left\"… I guess #C236196003Sakura#CDEF is referring to\nthe secret recipe behind her tea blend."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "903084"
msgid "Alright. At some point, I'll peek through the\ncurtains and see how she mixes this."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "903168"
msgid "Admittedly though, I need to prioritize exploring."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "903220"
msgid "Now that I've had some tea and a breather,\nI guess I could go for a trip to the Labyrinth."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "903312"
msgid "…Senpai? Um, just looking at your\nheart rate and brain waves… Are you\nenjoying this?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "903400"
msgid "My head has been hazy ever since I got away\nfrom #C236196003BB#CDEF back at the Core, but I feel like it's all gone away."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "903524"
msgid "…w-well, I think that it's good to be\npositive, but don't force yourself… When\nyou're having a tough time, please say so."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "903648"
msgid "?\n#C236196003Sakura#CDEF is being oddly serious.\nWhat is she talking about?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "903724"
msgid "It's tough for me to see #C236196003Rin#CDEF and #C236196003Rani#CDEF\nlook so down and you forcing yourself\nto laugh, Senpai."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "903852"
msgid "…I understand how everyone feels.\nEvery battle we fought up until now was\nin vain… We lost from the start."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "903964"
msgid "No matter what we could've tried,\nour chances of catching up to #C236196003BB#CDEF were zero."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "904060"
msgid "That's why #C236196003BB#CDEF was so carefree, and why the\n#C000246204Sakura Labyrinth#CDEF was just entertainment\nshe made to torment everyone…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "904208"
msgid "That's why #C236196003BB#CDEF was so carefree, and why the\n#C000246204Sakura Labyrinth#CDEF was just entertainment\nshe made to torment you, Senpai…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "904360"
msgid "#C236196003Sakura#CDEF is right.\nIt frustrates me to say that we weren't\neven a threat to #C236196003BB#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "904472"
msgid "I recall what #C236196003BB#CDEF said when I fought her:"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "904532"
msgid "\"The world has been my toy for a while now.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "904580"
msgid "At that moment, #C236196003BB#CDEF knew that she would\nultimately reach the Core."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "904664"
msgid "…yes. That's why I understand why you're\ndejected. But please don't give in to despair."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "904756"
msgid "Please don't go walking around the school,\nand don't try going to the Labyrinth."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "904840"
msgid "It's pointless to do anything since the future is decided.\nAnd that proves that challenging #C236196003BB#CDEF would be\na foolish choice to make."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "904988"
msgid "It's weird to be thinking about walking around\nthe old school building and checking out what's going\non in the Labyrinth at this point."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "905124"
msgid "It's weird, but still."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "905148"
msgid "Senpai, are you saying… that you haven't\nquit yet?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "905200"
msgid "Hearing #C236196003Sakura#CDEF say this, I finally and clearly\nwas able to realize #RUBS   this shape#RUBEthese words#REND."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "905324"
msgid "Did I have a drastic change of heart at some point,\nor am I so simple-minded that a little smack got me back\nto my senses?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "905448"
msgid "Whichever it is, doesn't matter.\nWhat's important is that right now, my mind is clear."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "905536"
msgid "Also, I was entrusted to take the reigns."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "905580"
msgid "If I want to always remember them,\nthen I can't go dropping the responsibilities\nI took over from them."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "905684"
msgid "Seriously. I'm appalled at how simple-minded I am."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "905736"
msgid "My one worry left is the one contradictory\nresult of our analyses:\n\"We probably still can't beat #C236196003BB#CDEF.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "905856"
msgid "No… you mustn't dare!\nIf you defy #C236196003BB#CDEF any more, you'll end up\ndeleted for certain this time…!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "905968"
msgid "I swore to protect everyone――to protect you.\nIt's the only promise I have left that I\ncan keep!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "906068"
msgid "No… you mustn't dare, Senpai!\nIf you defy #C236196003BB#CDEF any more, you'll end up\ndeleted for certain this time…!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "906188"
msgid "I swore to protect everyone――to protect you,\nSenpai. It's the only promise I have left that\nI can keep!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "906296"
msgid "And yet, you still…… I don't understand."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "906340"
msgid "This school building is the one and only safe\nworld there is; you'll be spared by staying\nhere; so why are you still fighting!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "906468"
msgid "#C236196003Sakura#CDEF is getting so vocal because she's\ngenuinely concerned about #C236196003#FAMILY #GIVEN#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "906584"
msgid "I bet I've been fighting this entire time because\nI'm the type of person who likes kind people like her."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "906692"
msgid "The reason you've been fighting is…\nto help people who care for others?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "906768"
msgid "To help me… no, to help people\nwho care for others?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "906824"
msgid "That's right.\nMy memory hasn't returned yet―――Well, I probably don't\nhave any memories."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "906916"
msgid "This \"#C236196003#FAMILY #GIVEN#CDEF\" person may be somewhat warped;\na Master lacking something normal people need to have."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "907040"
msgid "I can't explain why my memories have been\nhazy this whole time otherwise.\nStill―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "907128"
msgid "Still, I've got something unshakable within me."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "907176"
msgid "Even if my #ROFS-002#RUBS    past #RUBEmemories#REND won't return to me, even if I have no#ROFS0001#RUBS  future#RUBE goals#REND,\nthere's a #ROFS-002#RUBS  present#RUBEme#REND right here, right now.\nI'm a nobody. I'm not fighting for some\nepic reason like saving the Earth or the Moon.\nThe only real thing I can hold on to are ordinary wishes."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "907520"
msgid "I am me.\nEven if parts of me are missing,\nthere's still a pulse going through my limbs."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "907608"
msgid "Even if I don't have the memories of my life,\nof all the stuff I did that must've been fun,\nof anything at all―I still remember that they\nwere important to me."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "907772"
msgid "I want to believe in warm people.\nI want to protect warm people."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "907840"
msgid "I know I had fallen into #RUBS    a long#RUBEan eternal#REND sleep,\ndreaming of such a future."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "907936"
msgid "So―――I bet those desires are what this body is made out of."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "908000"
msgid "Even if everything is an illusion.\nEven if this body is some sort of afterimage."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "908084"
msgid "#C236196003#FAMILY #GIVEN#CDEF is important to me,\nand the people I love are important to me."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "908180"
msgid "All I insist on wanting to protect are the\nthings I see within reach."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "908252"
msgid "I thank her for the tea and stand up."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "908292"
msgid "Thanks to #C236196003Sakura#CDEF, my doubts are gone.\nNow that I've decided such, I can't stand around any longer."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "908408"
msgid "I don't see #C236196003Sakura#CDEF. There's no one here.\nI don't really have any business here,\nbut I sit down in a chair anyway."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "908540"
msgid "Maybe I let my fatigue get to me since this area is safe."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "908600"
msgid "…as I think to myself that I mustn't fall asleep,\nI gently doze off―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "908676"
msgid "―――Feeling as if someone had called me, I wake up."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "908732"
msgid "I must be tired from all the battles.\nLooks like I sat down and fell asleep for a few minutes."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "908828"
msgid "I leave the Infirmary."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "908852"
msgid "\n\n\nIn a far too fleeting dream,\nI saw the afterimage of one girl's determination."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "908936"
msgid "Looky here! My processing speed is as fast as \nlightning! You look like you're in good shape,\ntoo, but I'll give you a run for your money."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "909076"
msgid "I removed various guards, making me more solid.\nI feel refreshed, like when a diet starts\nshowing progress."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "909184"
msgid "Yeah, it's just like when you start trimming\nsome belly squish―― Er, forget it.\nNevermind. I've never been fat."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "909300"
msgid "A-anyway, I'm all set on my side.\nDon't worry about a thing,\njust jump straight into that final battle."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "909404"
msgid "All my self-diagnosis system levels are nominal.\nI'm able to maintain my avatar."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "909488"
msgid "However… Every time I think about how I'll\nnever see this setting again, my emotion\nregulator produces not unpleasant feelings."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "909620"
msgid "My self-diagnoses aren't being affected,\nso it may be a product of my cerebral nerves…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "909708"
msgid "It surprises even me that I have such thoughts\nof \"attachment\" to this place,\nhaving kept so distant."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "909812"
msgid "My #C000246204SGs#CDEF were forcibly extracted,\nI had disgraceful qualities made up for me――\nMy time here was quite the headache…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "909948"
msgid "But now, I feel like even those errors\nare precious to me. All in all,\nI think I had a worthwhile experience."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "910060"
msgid "Now please head off to battle.\nIt's time for you to put an end to this,\nby your own hands."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "910152"
msgid "Ah… e-erm… I-I don't really have any\nwords to send you off with!\nI couldn't think of anything \"cool\" to say…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "910264"
msgid "I'm hopeless, aren't I…\nAll I can ever talk about is work…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "910328"
msgid "While in newfound wonder, I answer #C236196003Sakura#CDEF's\nquestion with an understated reaction:\n\"#[You look great][You look adorable]#.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "910468"
msgid "Her trademark white gown and pale colored\nhair glowed against the dark blue sailor uniform."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "910560"
msgid "And coupled with her graceful movements, she was like\nthe #[sweet classmate who was secretly popular with the boys][admirable kouhai you'd start to care for without realizing]# \n…is the sort of impression I get."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "910776"
msgid "That example is kind of embarrassing…\nbut I am glad you do not think I look weird."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "910860"
msgid "Also, I feel as if my processing speed has\nincreased somewhat… perhaps because I have been\noptimized? Thank you very much, #C236196003#GIVEN#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "911008"
msgid "All that matters is that she liked it.\nI was strangely all nervous about it,\nbut I'm still glad I got her a matching uniform."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "911136"
msgid "Yes. I will be supporting you as best I can,\nso please do your best as well."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "911216"
msgid "…and, thank you very much. I am having trouble\nfinding the words to say―but I am happy."
msgstr ""

